window.LegacyQuestionData = {"schemaVersion":1,"companies":{"asml":{"id":"asml","name":"asml","shortName":"asml","status":"active","role":"","eyebrow":"","title":"","summary":"","accent":"navy","categories":[{"id":"script","label":"專屬劇本","icon":"script","description":"","introHtml":"<div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-blue-800 rounded-2xl shadow-md p-5 text-white mb-4\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-black mb-1\">ASML UIR 核心劇本</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-blue-100 text-[13px]\">策略：北科純機械 + 台積2奈米PVD裝機 + CNC工安紀律</p>\n                </div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden group\">\n                    <button data-action=\"toggle-card\" class=\"btn-press w-full p-4 text-left flex gap-4 items-center hover:bg-sky-50/50 transition-colors\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><span data-icon=\"route\" class=\"text-slate-600\"></span></div>\n                        <div class=\"flex-grow\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-slate-800 text-[15px]\">短中長期職涯規劃 <span class=\"tag tag-must ml-1\">🔥 升級版</span></h3></div>\n                        <span data-icon=\"chevron\" class=\"text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-300 transform\"></span>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"accordion-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"accordion-inner\">\n                            <div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                <p><strong class=\"text-sky-700\">短期 (0-1年) - 戰力成型：</strong>快速取得黃光量測設備的獨立值班認證 (Certification)。完全適應輪班與無塵室的高壓節奏，確保交接班 (Handover) 資訊零落差。目標是做到「機台 Alarm 能直覺依 SOP 在最短時間內排除」。</p>\n                                <p><strong class=\"text-sky-700\">中期 (1-3年) - 系統防堵：</strong>成為班內的 Technical Reference。我會將過去在日月光使用的「品保工具（如魚骨圖、柏拉圖）」帶入日常維護中。結合美光的 FDC/SPC 系統，抓出最常發生的 Top 3 異常，將被動的 CM (故障維修) 轉化為 Proactive PM (預防保養)。</p>\n                                <p><strong class=\"text-sky-700\">長期 (3年以上) - 跨部門整合：</strong>帶領新進工程師，並參與跨部門的 CIP (持續改善專案)。利用我在半導體一線廠累積的「產線思維」，與製程工程師 (PE) 合作進行量測參數微調，從設備端提出優化方案，提升整體黃光區的 Throughput 與良率。</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>","questions":[{"id":"asml.script.8m21d4","question":"2-Min Core Interview (兩分鐘標準版)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                <p>Good morning/afternoon interviewers. My name is Lyor Zhuang. I am a person who values discipline and practical details.</p>\n                                <p><strong>[Dual Background]</strong> I hold a Bachelor's in Mechanical Engineering from NTUT with CNC and Lathe licenses, providing strong hardware fundamentals. Later, I earned my Master's in Advanced Semiconductor Packaging from NSYSU, which enables me to grasp semiconductor processes quickly.</p>\n                                <p><strong>[TSMC Experience]</strong> Previously, I worked as a PVD Equipment Engineer at TSMC's 2nm fab. I managed AMAT Endura systems. Beyond daily troubleshooting, I took full ownership of controlling installation schedules and executing tool qualifications. I am deeply familiar with the fast-paced fab environment and strict cleanroom rules.</p>\n                                <p><strong>[Why UIR]</strong> I want to transition from a fab environment to the equipment vendor side, specifically focusing on hardware installation. With my hands-on mechanical skills and proven track record in TSMC tool installations, I am confident I can hit the ground running with ASML's install and upgrade tasks. Thank you.</p>\n                            </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.script.l82eh3","question":"Full 3-Min Self-Intro (完整中英底稿)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                <div class=\"bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-100\">\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-blue-700 mb-2 border-b border-blue-200 pb-1\">中文版完整底稿</h4>\n                                    <p class=\"mb-2\">各位主管好，我是莊瀚洲(Lyor)。很榮幸面試 ASML UIR 職缺。我想從「學歷優勢、裝機實戰、專案能力」三個面向說明我為何是絕佳人選。</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>第一，雙料背景：</strong>我畢業於北科大機械系，擁有CNC銑床與車床證照，賦予我極強的硬體視圖與機械直覺；隨後取得中山封測所碩士。這讓我既有機械底子，又具備半導體製程知識，能比純機械或純製程背景的人更快上手 ASML 精密機台的系統邏輯。</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>第二，高度匹配的裝機經歷：</strong>我在台積電2奈米廠擔任PVD設備工程師，負責 AMAT Endura 機台。我不僅處理日常 Trouble-shooting，更負責了新廠機台裝機時程控管與品質驗證。我非常熟悉晶圓廠內從機台移入、組裝、測試到交機的完整高壓節奏，確保「如期導入量產動能」。</p>\n                                    <p><strong>第三，專案管理與數據優化：</strong>過去在日月光及村田機械擔任工程師時，我主導新材料導入與 TSMC AP6B 建廠 Layout 規劃，培養了極強的跨部門溝通與獨立解題能力。總結來說，我的實戰經驗能完美對應 UIR 需求，有信心為團隊帶來貢獻。</p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"bg-blue-50/30 p-3 rounded-lg border border-blue-100\">\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-700 mb-2 border-b border-slate-200 pb-1\">English Version</h4>\n                                    <p class=\"mb-2\">Good morning/afternoon, hiring managers. My name is Lyor Zhuang. I'd like to highlight my academic background, hands-on installation experience, and project skills.</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>First, Dual Background:</strong> I hold a Bachelor's in Mechanical Engineering from NTUT with CNC and Lathe licenses, providing strong hardware fundamentals. My Master's in Semiconductor Packaging from NSYSU enables me to quickly grasp both physical assembly and semiconductor processes.</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>Second, Installation Experience:</strong> At TSMC's 2nm fab, I managed AMAT Endura PVD systems. Beyond troubleshooting, I took full ownership of controlling installation schedules and executing tool qualifications. I am deeply familiar with the fast-paced fab environment—from uncrating to mass production readiness.</p>\n                                    <p><strong>Third, Project Management:</strong> In my previous roles at ASE and Muratec, I managed new thermal material projects and fab AS/RS layouts, honing my cross-functional communication. In conclusion, my proven track record in TSMC makes me highly confident in my ability to excel as a UIR Engineer.</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"tech","label":"專業邏輯","icon":"wrench","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">🛠️ 專業與邏輯測驗 (10題)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"asml.tech.j2pld8","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考核心1. 英文技術文件閱讀 (指定動作下一步)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 攻防策略：大聲朗讀關鍵字。回答：「根據 SPEC，這一步完成後的 Check-point 是什麼，確認無誤後，下一步才是 OOO。」絕不靠感覺裝機。\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.tech.2uk1qn","question":"2. 介面除錯比對 (電腦 vs 機台UI)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 攻防策略：展現台積 End Point 系統建置經驗。「我會從左上到右下網格化掃視。先核對數值、單位，再確認軟體版本號與連線狀態燈號是否一致。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.tech.eo1t14","question":"3. 流程圖判斷 (左右對照是否可下一步)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 攻防策略：尋找 <span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold\">防呆條件</span>。「左邊要求壓力達標或閥門開啟，右邊顯示 Error 或數值不足，因此『不可』下一步，須先 Trouble-shooting 壓力源。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.tech.jjfuoa","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考核心4. 螺絲鎖固邏輯 (法蘭片 Flange)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 攻防策略：展現機械科班底蘊。「必須 <strong class=\"text-blue-600\">對角線交叉鎖緊 (Cross-pattern tightening)</strong>，避免應力集中導致 O-ring 變形洩漏。實務上會分段上扭力 (手轉-&gt;50%-&gt;100%)。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.tech.ra7w39","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考核心5. 閥門狀態確認 (如何確認球閥開一半)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 攻防策略：「不依賴肉眼目測。我會先將閥門完全打開，紀錄全關所需的總圈數，再往回轉動總圈數的一半，確保精準。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.tech.aqoknh","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考核心6. 工安危機辨識 (A字梯找碴)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 攻防策略：<strong>工安天條</strong>。檢查：1.拉桿安全扣是否扣上。2.有無防滑墊。3.最上方兩階嚴禁站立。4.周邊需有警示或 Buddy 戒護。\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.tech.n3b2w8","question":"⭐⭐ 高頻題7. 交叉比對邏輯 (發電機與筆電不充電)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 攻防策略：單一變數控制。「將壞筆電換好線，能充代表線壞。若不行，將線接好筆電，好筆電若也掛了，代表孔位有問題，需換發電機孔位交叉驗證。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"high","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.tech.jttltv","question":"8. 保養定義 (What is equipment maintenance?)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 攻防策略：\"Maintenance is divided into Preventive Maintenance (PM) to replace parts before they fail, and Corrective Maintenance (CM) for unexpected troubleshooting.\"\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.tech.9g4ttp","question":"⭐ 加分題9. UIR 在做什麼？ / 對 ASML 的了解？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 攻防策略：\"UIR stands for Upgrade, Install, and Relocation. It involves unpacking, hardware assembly, hook-up, and executing strict qualifications for EUV/DUV systems.\"\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.tech.p95by2","question":"10. 無塵室如何確保作業安全？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 攻防策略：拿出 CNC 證照與台積經驗。「除了台積電嚴格的廠規，我考取 CNC 與車床證照的訓練教會我 <strong>嚴格遵守 SOP</strong> 與 <strong>機台操作紀律</strong>。在工廠裡操作高速主軸，一個失誤就會導致重傷；無塵室也是一樣，對工安絕不妥協。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"product","label":"產品速覽","icon":"microchip","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">🤖 ASML 產品線與術語速覽</h3>","questions":[{"id":"asml.product.gl8veb","question":"📚 UIR 現場高頻專有名詞 (Glossary)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2\">\n                                    <li><strong class=\"text-blue-700\">TIS (Tool-Induced Shift):</strong> 機台本身造成的偏移誤差，UIR 裝機調校時極力要消除的誤差源。</li>\n                                    <li><strong class=\"text-blue-700\">COMA (彗形像差):</strong> 光學像差的一種，光線偏離主軸造成拖尾現象，考驗鏡片調校精度。</li>\n                                    <li><strong class=\"text-blue-700\">Reticle (光罩):</strong> 印有積體電路圖案的石英板。</li>\n                                    <li><strong class=\"text-blue-700\">Chuck (吸盤):</strong> 固定 Wafer 的精密載台（通常是靜電或真空吸附）。</li>\n                                    <li><strong class=\"text-blue-700\">Wafer Stage (晶圓載台):</strong> 負責承載並以奈米級精度高速移動晶圓的磁浮平台。</li>\n                                    <li><strong class=\"text-blue-700\">WoW (Way of Working):</strong> ASML 內部的標準作業規範與流程總稱。</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.product.sdsbc8","question":"Question 2","answerHtml":"","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"en","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.product.sdsbc7","question":"Question 3","answerHtml":"","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"en","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.product.sdsbc6","question":"Question 4","answerHtml":"","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"en","tags":[]}]},{"id":"motiv","label":"動機特質","icon":"motivation","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">🎯 動機與特質 (10題)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"asml.motiv.vb0rsl","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考核心1. 為什麼離開上份工作？(推力與拉力)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 絕不抱怨。「推力：在台積電量產後的維護較難滿足我從無到有建構機台的成就感。拉力：UIR 專注前期裝機，能完美結合我的機械手感與 2 奈米裝機經驗，這是我渴望深耕的技術前線。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.motiv.qyct6y","question":"⭐⭐ 高頻題2. 科系與裝機無關？沒有手工安裝經驗？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「關聯極高。我雖是封測碩士，但大學是純機械並有 CNC 證照，對金屬加工、鎖固應力有真實肌肉記憶。在台積也實際參與 PVD 裝機，無塵室硬體拆裝如同呼吸般熟悉。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"high","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.motiv.5ewkm7","question":"3. 選擇 ASML 最看重哪三點？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「1. 技術獨特性(微影無可取代)。 2. 扎實的教育訓練系統。 3. 解決問題的工程文化(能讓我實際動手並看到具體成果)。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.motiv.owrj9y","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考核心4. 給我三個理由錄取你？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「1. 具備『機械底+半導體』雙引擎。 2. 經歷台積 2 奈米建廠高壓裝機節奏，是即戰力。 3. 日月光/村田專案經驗，懂得與跨部門(廠務/產線)有效溝通。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.motiv.ydbs21","question":"5. 你的優缺點是什麼？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「優點：極強實作能力與高工安意識。缺點：對基礎光學物理較不熟。但我會利用 ASML 訓練系統與研讀英文手冊，用我的機械直覺來補足。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.motiv.lbs2g0","question":"6. 新訓時跟不上進度怎麼辦？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「主動利用下班時間梳理筆記、對照 Manual。有盲點立刻具體條列，隔天空檔向教官精準提問。絕不把問題留到上機實作才爆發。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.motiv.qdzqp9","question":"7. 發現同事上班偷懶怎麼辦？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 展現 <strong>Ownership</strong>。「若是團隊裝機，偷懶會危及工安與進度。我會先善意提醒共同壓力；若未改善，我會秉持專業向 Team Lead 反映客觀事實，不包庇。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.motiv.8k09px","question":"8. 在學校最擅長與最不擅長學科？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「最擅長機械製圖，我懂看圖拆裝設備。最不擅長純理論數學，但我透過 CNC 工廠實作彌補，養成了『動手做讓數據說話』的習慣。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.motiv.toxtor","question":"9. 團體合作中扮演什麼角色？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「我常扮演『整合橋樑』。在台積建廠時需對接 Vendor 與廠務，困難在對齊所有人時程。我透過釐清 Critical Path (要徑) 並主動發布進度，確保團隊不卡關。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.motiv.etxv8w","question":"10. 輪班、穿無塵服或支援國內外裝機願意嗎？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「完全沒問題。在台積電現場我已完全習慣無塵服與高壓節奏。我平時有健身與保養車輛習慣，體能狀態極佳，隨時準備好全球外派。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"behav","label":"經歷行為","icon":"briefcase","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">💼 經歷與行為 (STAR 法則)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"asml.behav.574u4t","question":"1. 具體說明之前負責的專案？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 提煉專案價值。「如『台積 Fab2&amp;5 End Point 系統建置』，我負責從無到有硬體線路規劃與改善。這教會我將抽象的配管/電路概念轉化為真實系統，與 UIR 整合邏輯一致。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.behav.lumay5","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考核心2. 遇過最大挑戰與解決方式？(裝機意料之外)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-1 rounded\">[S 情境]</strong> 在台積電 Fab22，PVD 機台進入關鍵裝機與驗證階段，時程極度緊縮且多廠商同時施工。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-1 rounded\">[T 任務]</strong> 必須確保機台在嚴格的時間節點內完成 Qualification，不影響後續產能爬坡。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-1 rounded\">[A 行動]</strong> 遇到突發 Error 時，我不只依賴 Vendor。我主動建立進度追蹤表，每天召開 brief meeting 對焦水電氣進度。更親自調閱 Error log，比對線路與機構找出異常點加速排障。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-1 rounded\">[R 結果]</strong> 最終成功在 Deadline 前完成驗證，如期導入量產動能。這鍛鍊出我在高壓環境冷靜排解問題的能力。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.behav.fygied","question":"3. 工作中最有成就感的事情？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「在村田機械用 CAD 畫出 TSMC AP6B 自動化倉儲(AS/RS) Layout，看著圖紙變成無塵室實際運作的巨型系統，那種『虛擬化為實體』的成就是無可取代的。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.behav.c63pb8","question":"⭐⭐ 高頻題4. 跨部門溝通有衝突的經驗？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-1 rounded\">[S 情境]</strong> 在台積電參與 End Point 系統建置，硬體管線配置時，新感測器外殼與原有設備發生干涉，且廠務與產線各有考量。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-1 rounded\">[T 任務]</strong> 需要在不破壞安全規範且不延誤工期的前提下，找到折衷的走線與安裝方案。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-1 rounded\">[A 行動]</strong> 衝突當下我不堅持己見。我打開 CAD 圖面與廠房施工規範(SOP)，用客觀的 3D 視角把雙方需求具象化，重新評估空間，修改轉接件導角。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-1 rounded\">[R 結果]</strong> 完美兼顧了走線安全與散熱，各部門看過圖面後順利放行。這讓我明白解決衝突的最佳武器是「規範與數據」。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"high","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.behav.4340uf","question":"5. 前公司想改變卻無能為力之事？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「大廠系統介面老舊冗長，基層難以改變 IT 系統。但我學會在既有框架下，建立自己的巨集與追蹤表單，用自己能力範圍內的方式提升當站效率。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.behav.krk8me","question":"6. 跟同事技術意見不合怎麼解決？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 <strong>Speak-up 文化</strong>。「核心原則：對事不對人，讓數據和 SOP 說話。我會先聽對方想法，再打開工程圖核對。用邏輯解決爭議，必要時尋求資深前輩裁定。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.behav.1tvgr3","question":"7. 面對高壓環境如何排解壓力？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「雙管齊下。物理上：透過健身或機車保養流汗重置身心。工作上：壓力來自技術不確定性，我會靜心讀 Manual 或與前輩討論。解決『根本問題 (Root Cause)』壓力自然消失。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.behav.oxioa5","question":"8. 未來職涯規劃？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「短期(半年)：通過工安訓練獨立完成基礎模組。中期(1-2年)：成為獨立作業主力快速解 Error。長期(3年以上)：成為 Mentor 協助解決複雜專案。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.behav.y3nl5","question":"9. 你的經驗能帶給團隊什麼？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「『無縫接軌的裝機戰力』與『Fab端使用者思維』。我知道台積電真正在意什麼標準，這能幫助 UIR 團隊在交機驗證時減少認知落差，更順利 Pass。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.behav.vf8csk","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考核心10. 犯過最蠢的錯？/ 專案實作困難？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-1 rounded\">[S 情境]</strong> 碩士研究金屬 TIM 時，面對材料在溫度循環後經常發生介面剝離與微裂紋的挫折。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-1 rounded\">[T 任務]</strong> 必須找出材料失效的根本原因 (Root Cause)，而非憑感覺盲目更改配方參數。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-1 rounded\">[A 行動]</strong> 我沒有重做整個實驗，而是將失效樣本進行 Cross-section，利用 SEM/EDX 顯微設備去檢查內部的 IMC (介金屬化合物) 結構厚度，並記錄精確的成分數據。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-1 rounded\">[R 結果]</strong> 成功找出了特定 IMC 層過厚導致脆化的主因，針對性修改溫度曲線後解決了問題。這養成了我「靠數據說話、追根究底」的 Trouble-shooting 習慣。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"sit","label":"情境應變","icon":"shield","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">🛡️ 情境與應變 (10題)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"asml.sit.tjo7da","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考核心1. 有步驟可省略以加快工作？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 <strong class=\"text-red-600\">陷阱題！絕對不可</strong>。「省略可能導致嚴重工安或機損。若發現步驟多餘，我會依『工程變更(EC)』提案總部，官方修改前，絕對 100% 按表操課。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.sit.cd5m5h","question":"2. 進來後跟想的不一樣怎麼辦？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「設備領域總有意外挑戰。我適應力強，遇落差會立刻調整心態，翻閱文件或請教資深學長。只要掌握底層機械與物理邏輯，任何事都能解構適應。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.sit.2sa4ji","question":"3. 理想中的 WLB 是什麼？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「工作時極度專注達標(能配合排班加班)，休假時徹底切換狀態充電。我會健身或保養機車，維持體能與對機械的熱忱，以最佳狀態迎接下週裝機。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.sit.xuy7hq","question":"⭐⭐ 高頻題4. 遇到完全沒見過的 Error 怎麼辦？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 面對 Ambiguity。「先確保機台 Safe state。調閱 Log 運用 <strong>5 Whys</strong> 分析。若超過 Time-box (如30分) 未解，立刻 Escalation (升級通報) 給二線，不逞英雄硬修。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"high","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.sit.ks6gf0","question":"5. 前輩做法與手冊衝突時聽誰的？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「拿出 Manual 當護身符。我會婉轉向學長確認：『手冊這裡寫XXX，我們這樣做會不會有疑慮？』一切以原廠最新版 SPEC 為最終圭臬。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.sit.d5ojfa","question":"6. 手上有多個緊急任務如何排優先級？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「1. 牽涉工安或機台毀損風險第一。2. 影響 Critical Path (全線產能) 第二。3. 例行保養或個人文書第三。無法消化時立刻回報主管調度資源。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.sit.i23964","question":"7. 被客戶(如台積)強烈施壓進度時？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「理解客戶焦慮，但堅持品質。我會用數據回應：『趕這3小時可能會造成後續數天的 Down機風險，我們按 SOP 穩紮穩打才能確保交機品質。』」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.sit.s5s7cb","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考核心8. 裝機弄壞零件，但沒人看到？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「絕對誠實回報 (Integrity)。隱瞞會導致後續極大的良率異常或系統崩潰，代價遠大於一個零件。誠實是 ASML 文化的核心底線。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.sit.kcnt1f","question":"9. 你適應力、抗壓性強的實例？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「在台積 PVD 部門，面對機台 Down 機與產能雙重夾擊，我必須在半夜翻閱 manual、比對 log 動手排障。我能保持冷靜依 SOP 排除，鍛鍊出極強韌性。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.sit.k501bd","question":"10. 你的核心特質適合這個職位嗎？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「我有很強的『韌性』與『探索精神』。不怕辛苦能適應各種無塵室，且渴望學習新技術(考取 CNC 證照)，這讓我非常適合 UIR 的動態環境。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"combat","label":"實戰攻防","icon":"combat text-amber-400","description":"","introHtml":"<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 px-2\">\n                    <span data-icon=\"bolt\" class=\"text-amber-500 text-xl\"></span>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-800\">考前衝刺：實戰中英攻防</h2>\n                </div><div class=\"space-y-3\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-rose-50 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-rose-200 overflow-hidden group qa-card\">\n                        <button data-action=\"toggle-card\" class=\"btn-press w-full p-4 text-left flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><span data-icon=\"skull-crossbones\" class=\"text-white\"></span></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-rose-900 text-[15px]\">🔥 最怕被問的死穴題 (Weak Spots)</h3></div>\n                            <span data-icon=\"chevron\" class=\"text-rose-500 transition-transform duration-300 transform\"></span>\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"accordion-wrapper\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-inner\">\n                                <div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 border-t border-rose-100 pt-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-rose-100\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-rose-700 mb-1\">Q1: 台積電做不到一年就走，抗壓性是不是不夠？</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\"><strong>攻防：</strong>絕對不要防禦，要主動進攻。「不是抗壓性不夠，而是『目標更明確』。在台積高壓環境我成功 Hold 住 PVD 驗證，但我發現我對『機台建構與升級(UIR)』的熱忱遠大於『量產維護』。趁年輕盡早轉入外商原廠深耕技術，是對職涯負責的表現。」</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-rose-100\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-rose-700 mb-1\">Q2: 你沒摸過 EUV 或光學機台，憑什麼覺得能勝任？</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\"><strong>攻防：</strong>「EUV 的底層仍是機械、真空與管線。我在台積維護極高真空的 PVD，懂腔體防漏與 O-ring 規範；我有 CNC 證照，懂金屬應力與精密鎖固。我不懂光學公式，但我絕對懂『如何把光學模組毫釐不差地裝上去』，這正是 UIR 最需要的硬戰力。」</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-rose-100\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-rose-700 mb-1\">Q3: 你的碩士論文(金屬 TIM 散熱)跟 UIR 裝機毫不相干？</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\"><strong>攻防：</strong>「論文題目不同，但『解決問題的框架(Framework)』相通。研究 TIM 讓我學會操作電子顯微鏡(SEM)、進行失效分析(FA)與看大量數據找出 Root Cause。這種用數據 Trouble-shooting 的思維，套用在機台排障上是完全一致的。」</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden group qa-card\">\n                        <button data-action=\"toggle-card\" class=\"btn-press w-full p-4 text-left flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><span data-icon=\"volume-up\" class=\"text-amber-600\"></span></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-slate-800 text-[15px]\">自我介紹與核心思維</h3></div>\n                            <span data-icon=\"chevron\" class=\"text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-300 transform\"></span>\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"accordion-wrapper\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-inner\">\n                                <div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q1: Please introduce yourself.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">Hello interviewers, my name is Lyor Zhuang. I am a person who values discipline and practical details.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">I graduated from NTUT with a major in Mechanical Engineering, and later earned my Master's in Advanced Semiconductor Packaging from NSYSU.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">I have practical engineering experience working at TSMC's 2nm fab as a PVD Equipment Engineer. This taught me how to strictly follow fab safety rules and manage installation schedules in a high-pressure environment.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">With my CNC machining licenses and hands-on skills, I am confident I can learn UIR tasks very fast.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden group qa-card\">\n                        <button data-action=\"toggle-card\" class=\"btn-press w-full p-4 text-left flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><span data-icon=\"compass\" class=\"text-amber-600\"></span></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-slate-800 text-[15px]\">動機與職務認知</h3></div>\n                            <span data-icon=\"chevron\" class=\"text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-300 transform\"></span>\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"accordion-wrapper\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-inner\">\n                                <div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q2: Why do you want to join us?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">First, I want a \"high-tech learning environment\" to build my skills quickly.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">Second, ASML provides a \"global working environment,\" where I can develop an international view.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">Third, and most importantly, your company has a strong \"problem-solving culture.\" This perfectly matches my passion for solving complex engineering problems.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q3: How does your TSMC experience help?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">At TSMC, I worked on AMAT Endura PVD systems. For precise installation, I strictly followed the engineering manual.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">For safety discipline, I am very used to cleanroom rules, so I can easily adapt to customer sites or high-pressure timelines.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q4: What do you know about the CS-UIR role?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">As far as I know, UIR is responsible for installing machines, upgrading modules, and moving equipment.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">It is a huge project that includes assembling large machines and connecting thousands of cables and pipes. We must strictly follow ASML's Way of Working (WoW).</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">With my hands-on mechanical experience and CNC training, I am very confident in the precision needed for UIR.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#f8faf7] rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-[#d7e1d4] overflow-hidden group qa-card\">\n                        <button data-action=\"toggle-card\" class=\"btn-press w-full p-4 text-left flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#71866e] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><span data-icon=\"language\" class=\"text-white\"></span></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-slate-800 text-[15px]\">English A4｜四題必練</h3><p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">短句、結論先行、每題約 45–60 秒</p></div>\n                            <span data-icon=\"chevron\" class=\"text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-300 transform\"></span>\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"accordion-wrapper\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-inner\">\n                                <div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 border-t border-[#d7e1d4] pt-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#e3eadf]\"><p class=\"font-bold text-[#52684e] mb-1\">1. Please introduce yourself.</p><p class=\"text-slate-700\">Good morning, and thank you for the opportunity. My name is Lyor Zhuang. I have a Bachelor's degree in Mechanical Engineering from NTUT and a Master's degree in Advanced Semiconductor Packaging from NSYSU. My experience combines system projects, semiconductor packaging, and hands-on PVD equipment support at TSMC's 2nm fab. I am used to working in a cleanroom, following strict safety procedures, and troubleshooting issues with data and hardware observations. I am applying for UIR because I want to grow from equipment support into installation, upgrade, and system integration work.</p></div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#e3eadf]\"><p class=\"font-bold text-[#52684e] mb-1\">2. What do you enjoy outside work?</p><p class=\"text-slate-700\">Outside work, I enjoy road cycling and strength training. They help me build discipline, patience, and focus. I also enjoy learning practical technical tools and organizing complex information into clear steps. These habits help me stay calm and persistent when I face a difficult engineering problem.</p></div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#e3eadf]\"><p class=\"font-bold text-[#52684e] mb-1\">3. What was your work situation at TSMC, and why did you leave?</p><p class=\"text-slate-700\">At TSMC's 2nm fab, I supported PVD equipment maintenance and process-related work in a high-pressure cleanroom environment. I learned how to follow strict SOPs, review data and equipment conditions, and work with different teams to resolve issues. I am grateful for that experience. My decision to leave was not because I could not handle the pressure. I want to move toward the equipment vendor side, where I can focus more on installation, upgrades, and system integration. That is the long-term direction I want to build.</p></div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#e3eadf]\"><p class=\"font-bold text-[#52684e] mb-1\">4. Are you considering other equipment companies?</p><p class=\"text-slate-700\">I am exploring opportunities that fit my long-term direction in high-precision semiconductor equipment. However, ASML is especially attractive to me because UIR combines hands-on installation, strict quality standards, global teamwork, and system-level problem solving. These responsibilities match both my mechanical background and my fab experience, so this is a role I am highly motivated to pursue.</p></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden group qa-card\">\n                        <button data-action=\"toggle-card\" class=\"btn-press w-full p-4 text-left flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><span data-icon=\"lightbulb\" class=\"text-amber-600\"></span></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-slate-800 text-[15px]\">專案與解決問題能力</h3></div>\n                            <span data-icon=\"chevron\" class=\"text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-300 transform\"></span>\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"accordion-wrapper\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-inner\">\n                                <div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q5: Tell us about your \"End Point System\" project at TSMC.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">The goal was to build an End Point monitoring system from scratch to improve etch tool efficiency.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">I was responsible for the hardware setup and subsequent equipment improvements.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">This project, which received a factory commendation, taught me how to construct a tool system from the ground up. This is very similar to how a UIR engineer understands different modules.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q6: Challenges faced and how you solved them?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">In my master's thesis on Metal TIM, the biggest challenge was finding the root cause of cracks during temp cycles.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">My solution was to cut open the failed samples (cross-section) and check the inside structure using SEM to record the exact data.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">This built my habit of \"finding the root cause,\" which is great for UIR Troubleshooting.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden group qa-card\">\n                        <button data-action=\"toggle-card\" class=\"btn-press w-full p-4 text-left flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><span data-icon=\"user-shield\" class=\"text-amber-600\"></span></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-slate-800 text-[15px]\">特質、工安意識與適應力</h3></div>\n                            <span data-icon=\"chevron\" class=\"text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-300 transform\"></span>\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"accordion-wrapper\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-inner\">\n                                <div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q7: How do you ensure safety in a cleanroom?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">My training for CNC and Lathe licenses, along with TSMC's fab rules, taught me the most important rule: \"Strictly follow SOP.\"</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">In a machine shop, breaking rules can cause severe injuries; at work in a fab, breaking SOPs can cause fatal accidents. I will use this spirit to work with my team and keep everyone safe.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q8: How do you resolve technical conflicts?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">My core rule is: \"Focus on the issue, not the person, and let data and SOP speak.\"</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">I will listen to their ideas first, then open the engineering drawings or ASML's WoW process to check together.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">By solving technical problems with logic, conflicts can easily be resolved.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q9: How do you handle stress?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">I handle stress through \"physical release\" (working out to reset) and \"solving the root cause.\"</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">Stress usually comes from technical uncertainty. I calm down, read the Manual, or discuss with seniors. When the root cause is solved, the stress naturally goes away.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q10: Are you willing to work shifts, wear cleanroom suits, and travel?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">No problem at all.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">As an Equipment Engineer at the TSMC site, I am totally used to the cleanroom environment and high-pressure shifts.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">I work out regularly, so my physical fitness is great. Whether it's local shifts or global travel, I look forward to the challenge.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-blue-200 overflow-hidden group qa-card\">\n                        <button data-action=\"toggle-card\" class=\"btn-press w-full p-4 text-left flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><span data-icon=\"question\" class=\"text-white\"></span></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-blue-900 text-[15px]\">Reverse Qs (反問面試官) <span class=\"tag tag-must ml-1\">🔥🔥 必備</span></h3></div>\n                            <span data-icon=\"chevron\" class=\"text-blue-500 transition-transform duration-300 transform\"></span>\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"accordion-wrapper\">\n                            <div class=\"accordion-inner\">\n                                <div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-3 border-t border-blue-100 pt-3 bg-white\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-blue-50/50 p-3 rounded border border-blue-100\">\n                                        <span class=\"text-blue-700 font-bold text-xs block mb-1\">【技術與營運層次】</span>\n                                        <p class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-blue-600\">1.</span> UIR Team 目前負責的 DUV 跟 EUV 裝機專案比重大概是多少？因應未來的 3800E 甚至 High-NA，團隊在技術培訓上有什麼準備？</p>\n                                        <p><span class=\"font-bold text-blue-600\">2.</span> 在裝機過程遇過最具挑戰的事情是什麼？團隊最後如何克服？</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-emerald-50/50 p-3 rounded border border-emerald-100 mt-2\">\n                                        <span class=\"text-emerald-700 font-bold text-xs block mb-1\">【團隊與文化層次】</span>\n                                        <p class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-emerald-600\">3.</span> 從您過去帶領團隊的經驗來看，一個「非常成功」的 UIR Engineer 在你們團隊裡，通常具備什麼樣的特質或習慣？</p>\n                                        <p><span class=\"font-bold text-emerald-600\">4.</span> 工作氣氛如何？卡關時大家會互相幫忙嗎？</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-purple-50/50 p-3 rounded border border-purple-100 mt-2\">\n                                        <span class=\"text-purple-700 font-bold text-xs block mb-1\">【個人發展層次】</span>\n                                        <p class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-purple-600\">5.</span> 在 UIR 起步的人，未來在公司內部的職涯發展路徑（如 Technical Support 或 Global Team）通常為何？</p>\n                                        <p class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-purple-600\">6.</span> 如果我有幸錄取，報到前您建議我優先加強哪方面的技能？</p>\n                                        <p><span class=\"font-bold text-purple-600\">7.</span> 針對今天的面試，我有哪裡需要改進，或是您對我有任何疑慮嗎？</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>","questions":[{"id":"asml.combat.rpii1f","question":"🔥 最怕被問的死穴題 (Weak Spots)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 border-t border-rose-100 pt-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-rose-100\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-rose-700 mb-1\">Q1: 台積電做不到一年就走，抗壓性是不是不夠？</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\"><strong>攻防：</strong>絕對不要防禦，要主動進攻。「不是抗壓性不夠，而是『目標更明確』。在台積高壓環境我成功 Hold 住 PVD 驗證，但我發現我對『機台建構與升級(UIR)』的熱忱遠大於『量產維護』。趁年輕盡早轉入外商原廠深耕技術，是對職涯負責的表現。」</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-rose-100\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-rose-700 mb-1\">Q2: 你沒摸過 EUV 或光學機台，憑什麼覺得能勝任？</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\"><strong>攻防：</strong>「EUV 的底層仍是機械、真空與管線。我在台積維護極高真空的 PVD，懂腔體防漏與 O-ring 規範；我有 CNC 證照，懂金屬應力與精密鎖固。我不懂光學公式，但我絕對懂『如何把光學模組毫釐不差地裝上去』，這正是 UIR 最需要的硬戰力。」</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-rose-100\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-rose-700 mb-1\">Q3: 你的碩士論文(金屬 TIM 散熱)跟 UIR 裝機毫不相干？</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\"><strong>攻防：</strong>「論文題目不同，但『解決問題的框架(Framework)』相通。研究 TIM 讓我學會操作電子顯微鏡(SEM)、進行失效分析(FA)與看大量數據找出 Root Cause。這種用數據 Trouble-shooting 的思維，套用在機台排障上是完全一致的。」</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.combat.grkg19","question":"自我介紹與核心思維","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q1: Please introduce yourself.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">Hello interviewers, my name is Lyor Zhuang. I am a person who values discipline and practical details.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">I graduated from NTUT with a major in Mechanical Engineering, and later earned my Master's in Advanced Semiconductor Packaging from NSYSU.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">I have practical engineering experience working at TSMC's 2nm fab as a PVD Equipment Engineer. This taught me how to strictly follow fab safety rules and manage installation schedules in a high-pressure environment.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">With my CNC machining licenses and hands-on skills, I am confident I can learn UIR tasks very fast.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.combat.nrkzvt","question":"動機與職務認知","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q2: Why do you want to join us?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">First, I want a \"high-tech learning environment\" to build my skills quickly.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">Second, ASML provides a \"global working environment,\" where I can develop an international view.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">Third, and most importantly, your company has a strong \"problem-solving culture.\" This perfectly matches my passion for solving complex engineering problems.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q3: How does your TSMC experience help?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">At TSMC, I worked on AMAT Endura PVD systems. For precise installation, I strictly followed the engineering manual.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">For safety discipline, I am very used to cleanroom rules, so I can easily adapt to customer sites or high-pressure timelines.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q4: What do you know about the CS-UIR role?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">As far as I know, UIR is responsible for installing machines, upgrading modules, and moving equipment.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">It is a huge project that includes assembling large machines and connecting thousands of cables and pipes. We must strictly follow ASML's Way of Working (WoW).</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">With my hands-on mechanical experience and CNC training, I am very confident in the precision needed for UIR.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.combat.m80lry","question":"English A4｜四題必練短句、結論先行、每題約 45–60 秒","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 border-t border-[#d7e1d4] pt-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#e3eadf]\"><p class=\"font-bold text-[#52684e] mb-1\">1. Please introduce yourself.</p><p class=\"text-slate-700\">Good morning, and thank you for the opportunity. My name is Lyor Zhuang. I have a Bachelor's degree in Mechanical Engineering from NTUT and a Master's degree in Advanced Semiconductor Packaging from NSYSU. My experience combines system projects, semiconductor packaging, and hands-on PVD equipment support at TSMC's 2nm fab. I am used to working in a cleanroom, following strict safety procedures, and troubleshooting issues with data and hardware observations. I am applying for UIR because I want to grow from equipment support into installation, upgrade, and system integration work.</p></div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#e3eadf]\"><p class=\"font-bold text-[#52684e] mb-1\">2. What do you enjoy outside work?</p><p class=\"text-slate-700\">Outside work, I enjoy road cycling and strength training. They help me build discipline, patience, and focus. I also enjoy learning practical technical tools and organizing complex information into clear steps. These habits help me stay calm and persistent when I face a difficult engineering problem.</p></div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#e3eadf]\"><p class=\"font-bold text-[#52684e] mb-1\">3. What was your work situation at TSMC, and why did you leave?</p><p class=\"text-slate-700\">At TSMC's 2nm fab, I supported PVD equipment maintenance and process-related work in a high-pressure cleanroom environment. I learned how to follow strict SOPs, review data and equipment conditions, and work with different teams to resolve issues. I am grateful for that experience. My decision to leave was not because I could not handle the pressure. I want to move toward the equipment vendor side, where I can focus more on installation, upgrades, and system integration. That is the long-term direction I want to build.</p></div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-[#e3eadf]\"><p class=\"font-bold text-[#52684e] mb-1\">4. Are you considering other equipment companies?</p><p class=\"text-slate-700\">I am exploring opportunities that fit my long-term direction in high-precision semiconductor equipment. However, ASML is especially attractive to me because UIR combines hands-on installation, strict quality standards, global teamwork, and system-level problem solving. These responsibilities match both my mechanical background and my fab experience, so this is a role I am highly motivated to pursue.</p></div>\n                                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.combat.kthe07","question":"專案與解決問題能力","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q5: Tell us about your \"End Point System\" project at TSMC.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">The goal was to build an End Point monitoring system from scratch to improve etch tool efficiency.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">I was responsible for the hardware setup and subsequent equipment improvements.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">This project, which received a factory commendation, taught me how to construct a tool system from the ground up. This is very similar to how a UIR engineer understands different modules.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q6: Challenges faced and how you solved them?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">In my master's thesis on Metal TIM, the biggest challenge was finding the root cause of cracks during temp cycles.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">My solution was to cut open the failed samples (cross-section) and check the inside structure using SEM to record the exact data.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">This built my habit of \"finding the root cause,\" which is great for UIR Troubleshooting.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.combat.z1tlpt","question":"特質、工安意識與適應力","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q7: How do you ensure safety in a cleanroom?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">My training for CNC and Lathe licenses, along with TSMC's fab rules, taught me the most important rule: \"Strictly follow SOP.\"</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">In a machine shop, breaking rules can cause severe injuries; at work in a fab, breaking SOPs can cause fatal accidents. I will use this spirit to work with my team and keep everyone safe.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q8: How do you resolve technical conflicts?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">My core rule is: \"Focus on the issue, not the person, and let data and SOP speak.\"</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">I will listen to their ideas first, then open the engineering drawings or ASML's WoW process to check together.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">By solving technical problems with logic, conflicts can easily be resolved.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q9: How do you handle stress?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">I handle stress through \"physical release\" (working out to reset) and \"solving the root cause.\"</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">Stress usually comes from technical uncertainty. I calm down, read the Manual, or discuss with seniors. When the root cause is solved, the stress naturally goes away.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1\">Q10: Are you willing to work shifts, wear cleanroom suits, and travel?</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">No problem at all.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700 mb-2\">As an Equipment Engineer at the TSMC site, I am totally used to the cleanroom environment and high-pressure shifts.</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-slate-700\">I work out regularly, so my physical fitness is great. Whether it's local shifts or global travel, I look forward to the challenge.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"asml.combat.ygx2j1","question":"Reverse Qs (反問面試官) 🔥🔥 必備","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-3 border-t border-blue-100 pt-3 bg-white\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-blue-50/50 p-3 rounded border border-blue-100\">\n                                        <span class=\"text-blue-700 font-bold text-xs block mb-1\">【技術與營運層次】</span>\n                                        <p class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-blue-600\">1.</span> UIR Team 目前負責的 DUV 跟 EUV 裝機專案比重大概是多少？因應未來的 3800E 甚至 High-NA，團隊在技術培訓上有什麼準備？</p>\n                                        <p><span class=\"font-bold text-blue-600\">2.</span> 在裝機過程遇過最具挑戰的事情是什麼？團隊最後如何克服？</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-emerald-50/50 p-3 rounded border border-emerald-100 mt-2\">\n                                        <span class=\"text-emerald-700 font-bold text-xs block mb-1\">【團隊與文化層次】</span>\n                                        <p class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-emerald-600\">3.</span> 從您過去帶領團隊的經驗來看，一個「非常成功」的 UIR Engineer 在你們團隊裡，通常具備什麼樣的特質或習慣？</p>\n                                        <p><span class=\"font-bold text-emerald-600\">4.</span> 工作氣氛如何？卡關時大家會互相幫忙嗎？</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-purple-50/50 p-3 rounded border border-purple-100 mt-2\">\n                                        <span class=\"text-purple-700 font-bold text-xs block mb-1\">【個人發展層次】</span>\n                                        <p class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-purple-600\">5.</span> 在 UIR 起步的人，未來在公司內部的職涯發展路徑（如 Technical Support 或 Global Team）通常為何？</p>\n                                        <p class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-purple-600\">6.</span> 如果我有幸錄取，報到前您建議我優先加強哪方面的技能？</p>\n                                        <p><span class=\"font-bold text-purple-600\">7.</span> 針對今天的面試，我有哪裡需要改進，或是您對我有任何疑慮嗎？</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]}]},"micron":{"id":"micron","name":"micron","shortName":"micron","status":"archived","role":"","eyebrow":"","title":"","summary":"","accent":"navy","categories":[{"id":"script","label":"專屬劇本","icon":"script","description":"","introHtml":"<div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-600 to-cyan-800 rounded-2xl shadow-md p-5 text-white mb-4\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-black mb-1\">美光 RDA 量測輪班工程師劇本</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-sky-100 text-[13px]\">策略：台積2奈米建廠實戰 + 參數調校與數據驅動 + 主動預防保養 + 適應輪班</p>\n                </div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden group\">\n                    <button data-action=\"toggle-card\" class=\"btn-press w-full p-4 text-left flex gap-4 items-center hover:bg-sky-50/50 transition-colors\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-sky-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><span data-icon=\"bullseye\" class=\"text-sky-600\"></span></div>\n                        <div class=\"flex-grow\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-slate-800 text-[15px]\">RDA 職位自我介紹 (核心武裝)</h3></div>\n                        <span data-icon=\"chevron\" class=\"text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-300 transform\"></span>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"accordion-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"accordion-inner\">\n                            <div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                <p>各位主管好，我是莊瀚洲。針對「RDA 黃光量測設備維護工程師」，我的優勢在於<strong>「新機台導入實戰」與「數據驅動的異常排查能力」</strong>。</p>\n                                <p>我在台積電 2 奈米廠擔任 PVD 設備工程師，直接參與了 AMAT Endura 的裝機、Hook-up 與嚴格的 Buy-off 驗收。這讓我非常熟悉半導體設備從 Vendor 交機到產線量產的完整導入流程與高壓節奏。</p>\n                                <p>針對量測機台需要的精準度，我曾在台積電從無到有建置 End Point 系統，習慣透過 Log 數據來進行 Troubleshooting 與尋找 Root Cause，而不只是被動的更換零件。此外，對於產線的品質控制，我能熟練運用 SPC 與 FDC 系統邏輯，從「人機料法環」維度快速定位異常。</p>\n                                <p>最後，我深知 RDA 輪班工作對於體能與交接紀律的極高要求。我平時有高強度公路車與重訓習慣，體能狀態極佳，加上我對無塵室 SOP 的嚴格堅持，我有絕對的信心能確保美光量測設備的高稼動率。謝謝。</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden group\">\n                    <button data-action=\"toggle-card\" class=\"btn-press w-full p-4 text-left flex gap-4 items-center hover:bg-sky-50/50 transition-colors\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><span data-icon=\"route\" class=\"text-slate-600\"></span></div>\n                        <div class=\"flex-grow\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-slate-800 text-[15px]\">短中長期職涯規劃 <span class=\"tag tag-must ml-1\">🔥 必備</span></h3></div>\n                        <span data-icon=\"chevron\" class=\"text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-300 transform\"></span>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"accordion-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"accordion-inner\">\n                            <div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                <p><strong class=\"text-sky-700\">短期 (0-1年)：</strong>快速取得黃光量測設備的獨立值班認證 (Certification)。熟練掌握機台的日常 PM 與基礎 Troubleshooting，完全適應輪班與無塵室的高壓節奏，確保交接班 (Handover) 資訊零落差。</p>\n                                <p><strong class=\"text-sky-700\">中期 (1-3年)：</strong>成為班內的 Technical Reference。熟練運用 SPC/FDC 系統，提前抓出機台異常趨勢，落實 Proactive Maintenance (預防保養)。同時期望參與新量測機台的評估與裝機驗收 (Buy-off)。</p>\n                                <p><strong class=\"text-sky-700\">長期 (3年以上)：</strong>帶領新進工程師，並參與跨部門的持續改善專案 (CIP)。例如與製程工程師 (PE) 合作進行量測參數微調，從設備端提出優化方案，提升整體黃光區的 Throughput。</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"bg-sky-50 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-sky-200 overflow-hidden group mt-6\">\n                    <button data-action=\"toggle-card\" class=\"btn-press w-full p-4 text-left flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-sky-600 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><span data-icon=\"question\" class=\"text-white\"></span></div>\n                        <div class=\"flex-grow\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-sky-900 text-[15px]\">Reverse Qs (向面試官提問)</h3></div>\n                        <span data-icon=\"chevron\" class=\"text-sky-500 transition-transform duration-300 transform\"></span>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"accordion-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"accordion-inner\">\n                            <div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-3 border-t border-sky-100 pt-3 bg-white\">\n                                <p><span class=\"font-bold text-sky-600\">1. 機台技術：</span>請問目前 RDA 團隊負責的主力量測設備是偏向 Overlay、CD-SEM 還是光學薄膜量測？未來是否有導入新世代量測機台的計畫？</p>\n                                <p><span class=\"font-bold text-sky-600\">2. 數據防堵：</span>在進行 Proactive PM 或異常防堵時，團隊目前最依賴的 FDC 或大數據系統是什麼？新人大概需要花多少時間熟悉這套系統？</p>\n                                <p><span class=\"font-bold text-sky-600\">3. 跨部門協作：</span>作為輪班工程師，在處理量測數據飄移或 Alarm 時，與 PE (製程工程師) 及 Vendor 的責任邊界通常是如何劃分的？</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>","questions":[]},{"id":"weakness","label":"弱點補強","icon":"chart","description":"","introHtml":"<div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-600 to-orange-600 rounded-2xl shadow-md p-5 text-white\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black mb-1\">上緯面試弱點 → 美光應戰修正版</h2><p class=\"text-rose-100 text-[13px]\">補強職涯規劃、產線異常、品質工具與延伸追問</p></div>","questions":[{"id":"micron.weakness.zefts5","question":"上次答不清楚1. 短、中、長期職涯規劃？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed space-y-3\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-700\">短期（0～1 年）：</strong>熟悉 RDA 團隊量測設備、PM、Calibration、Golden Wafer、Alarm 邏輯與交接制度，取得獨立值班認證。目標是不只照 SOP 操作，也能說明每個 Check point 的目的。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-700\">中期（1～3 年）：</strong>成為能獨立處理異常的工程師，結合 Alarm、Log、SPC、FDC 與維修紀錄，找出高頻失效模式，降低重複 Alarm 與非預期停機。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-700\">長期（3 年以上）：</strong>成為設備與製程間的技術橋樑，參與新設備導入、Buy-off、CIP 與新人培訓，成為能處理複雜系統問題的 Technical Reference。</p>\n                    <div class=\"bg-sky-50 border border-sky-200 rounded-lg p-3\"><strong>追問：為什麼你能做到？</strong><p class=\"mt-1\">我已在台積電經歷新機導入、Vendor 協調、設備驗證與量產壓力，也在日月光接觸產線異常。我要補的是美光特定設備知識，而不是重新學習 Fab 節奏與責任觀念。</p></div>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.weakness.8bjdtn","question":"必備 STAR2. 日月光最深刻的產線異常？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed space-y-3\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg p-3\"><strong>請把中括號換成你的真實資料，避免被追問時失真。</strong></div>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-700\">S：</strong>在日月光進行新型散熱／封裝材料導入時，產線出現［黏著不良／厚度漂移／空洞率升高］，並集中於特定批次。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-700\">T：</strong>在不影響出貨時程下，先隔離風險批次，再判斷異常來自材料、設備、參數或操作差異。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-700\">A：</strong>先確認量測系統，再以柏拉圖鎖定主要不良模式；使用人、機、料、法、環、測魚骨圖縮小變因，並以正常／異常批次交叉比對及小型 DOE 驗證。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-700\">R：</strong>確認主因為［真實原因］，修訂參數或作業標準，使不良率由［X%］降至［Y%］，並將檢查點納入後續管制。</p>\n                    <p class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-lg p-3\"><strong>數字記不清楚：</strong>「確切百分比我不希望憑印象亂報，但改善後異常明顯收斂，且確認項目被納入標準流程。」</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.weakness.5eehlw","question":"品質工具3. 品保七大手法如何用在設備異常？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed space-y-2\">\n                    <p><strong>查檢表：</strong>記錄 Alarm、時間、Lot、Recipe、零件壽命與環境條件。</p><p><strong>柏拉圖：</strong>找出造成最多 Downtime 的主要問題。</p><p><strong>魚骨圖：</strong>依人、機、料、法、環、測展開原因。</p><p><strong>直方圖：</strong>觀察分布、偏移、雙峰與變異。</p><p><strong>散佈圖：</strong>確認溫度、壓力、使用次數與異常的關聯。</p><p><strong>管制圖：</strong>區分一般與特殊原因變異。</p><p><strong>層別法：</strong>依機台、班別、產品、Recipe 或零件批號拆分。</p>\n                    <div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-lg p-3\"><strong class=\"text-amber-300\">30 秒答法：</strong>我先用查檢表確保資料完整，再以柏拉圖鎖定主要損失；透過層別與魚骨圖縮小變因，最後用散佈圖、管制圖或小型實驗驗證，將經驗判斷轉成團隊可重複使用的證據。</div>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.weakness.igso80","question":"4. 被突然追問時如何避免腦袋空白？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed space-y-3\"><p>使用「<strong class=\"text-indigo-700\">結論－例子－方法－結果</strong>」：先講判斷，再選一個真實案例，說明如何隔離風險與縮小變因，最後交代結果及標準化。</p><p class=\"bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg p-3\">爭取時間：「這題我想用一個實際案例回答，我先花幾秒整理情境。」</p><p class=\"bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg p-3\">沒有完全相同經驗：「我沒有遇過完全相同的狀況，但我處理過底層邏輯相近的問題。」</p></div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"tech","label":"專業邏輯","icon":"microchip","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-l-4 border-sky-500\">專業與邏輯測驗 (10題)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"micron.tech.nnbflk","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考核心1. 何謂主動預防保養 (Proactive PM)？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「不僅是按表操課換零件(CM)，而是透過 FDC 監控機台參數(如馬達電流、Sensor數值)的趨勢微小變化。在數值超出 control limit 導致當機前，提前排定 PM 介入，極大化機台 Uptime。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.tech.wivtzb","question":"2. 品保與驗證工具的使用經驗？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 結合上緯面試經驗。「雖不一定每天手繪魚骨圖，但我熟悉其『根因分析(Root Cause)』邏輯。設備端我更常運用 SPC 監控量測數據 Trend，發生 OOC 異常時，直覺從『人機料法環』維度排查變異源。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.tech.9px8k1","question":"3. 如何進行機台的參數微調 (Fine-tuning)？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「微調必須是 Data-driven 的。我會設計 DOE，每次只調整單一變數(如平台移動速度或對焦時間)，觀察量測數據的再現性(Reproducibility)，找到最佳的 Recipe 甜蜜點。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.tech.yofc8p","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考核心4. 新機台導入 (Vendor Coordinate) 經驗？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「在台積電 2nm 建廠時，我負責協調廠務與 AMAT 原廠進行 Hook-up。我會嚴格對齊 Schedule，確認水電氣規格，並親自參與最終的 Buy-off 測試，確保硬體穩定度達標後才放行給製程端。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.tech.bx5zqx","question":"5. 什麼是 FDC 與 SPC 系統？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「FDC (Fault Detection and Classification) 收集設備感測器的高頻數據來監控機台健康；SPC (Statistical Process Control) 則是監控產品量測結果的變異趨勢。兩者結合能精準定位異常是來自機台硬體還是製程。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.tech.8ii93q","question":"6. 面對複雜 Alarm 的 Troubleshooting 邏輯？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「絕不盲目 Reset。第一步：確保機台 Safe state。第二步：調閱 Error Log 與 FDC 歷史曲線。第三步：運用 5 Whys 與交叉比對法，切斷變數(如更換模組測試)，精準鎖定失效的硬體元件。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.tech.nppdf6","question":"⭐⭐ 高頻題7. PVD 與黃光量測機台的差異？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「PVD 重視真空度、電漿穩定；量測機台(如 CD-SEM)更重視光學對位、Sensor 精度與抗震動。雖然硬體核心不同，但『透過 Log 抓 Root cause』與『嚴格執行 PM』的設備維護邏輯是完全相通的。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"high","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.tech.yghhs3","question":"8. 交叉驗證法 (Cross-matching) 實例？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「當量測數據異常時，我會將同一片 Wafer 放進另一台同型號健康的 Tool 量測。如果結果正常，代表是原機台硬體飄移；如果結果一樣異常，則極大機率是上一站製程異常(如曝光失焦)，藉此釐清權責。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.tech.ht9toy","question":"9. 無塵室硬體操作的防呆觀念？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「我擁有 CNC 銑床與車床證照，對機構公差非常敏感。在鎖固光學元件或腔體法蘭時，我嚴格遵守對角線分段上扭力的 SOP，避免應力不均導致微變形影響量測準確度。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.tech.8e1hn1","question":"10. 如何確保量測機台的精準度 (Precision)？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「定期使用 Golden Wafer 進行 Calibration。確保機台的環境控制(溫濕度、微震動)在 SPEC 內。如果有硬體更換(如光源或鏡頭)，必須重新執行嚴格的對位補償與 Gage R&amp;R 測試。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"motiv","label":"動機特質","icon":"motivation","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-l-4 border-sky-500\">動機與特質 (10題)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"micron.motiv.l0d7v7","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考核心1. 為什麼想離開台積，來美光 RDA 黃光量測？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「量測(Metrology)是半導體的『眼睛』。在台積維護 PVD 後，我深刻體會『精準的數據監控』才是提升良率的關鍵。美光 RDA 強調數據驅動與機台優化，這與我喜歡抓 Root cause 的工程性格完美契合。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.motiv.fhb0ua","question":"2. 因為健康因素離開？對 RDA 輪班的看法？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 <span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold\">絕對不提健康疑慮。</span>「過去是為職涯轉換做短期充電。我平時維持高強度公路車與重訓習慣，體能狀態極佳。在台積已完全適應無塵室高壓節奏，對美光的輪班排程，我已做好 100% 生理與心理準備。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.motiv.d121b5","question":"3. 從 PVD 轉量測，能適應嗎？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「絕對可以。我碩論研究金屬散熱材料時，大量使用 SEM/EDX 進行微觀量測，這讓我對光學與電子束量測系統有一定的概念。加上我扎實的機械拆裝底子，跨模組適應對我來說很快。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.motiv.ph5ebq","question":"4. 如何展現你的「好奇心與求知欲 (Curious)」？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「我原本是純機械系，但我主動跨考封裝碩士，考取 CNC 證照，甚至在台積電從無到有建出 End Point 系統。我習慣打破舒適圈去拆解未知的技術難題。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.motiv.432x9l","question":"⭐⭐ 高頻題5. 團隊協作 (Collaborative) 對你來說是什麼？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「是『資訊的透明與無縫交接』。特別是輪班工作，上一班沒修完的機台，我會確保交接清單(Passdown)上清楚列出已排除的變數與目前的 Alarm 狀態，讓下一班能立刻接手。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"high","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.motiv.35o7ve","question":"6. 適應動態環境 (Dynamic Environment) 的例子？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「在台積建廠初期，每天時程都在變動。我必須在 Vendor 缺料、廠務斷電的突發狀況中，靈活排定優先順序(Prioritization)，確保最重要的 PVD 驗證能如期完成。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.motiv.5b462l","question":"7. 對美光這間公司的了解？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「美光是全球記憶體(DRAM/NAND)的頂尖領導者。特別在先進節點的記憶體製造上，黃光量測設備的穩定度直接決定了疊對(Overlay)的良率。加入 RDA 等於是守護記憶體製程的最前線。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.motiv.eh5n8w","question":"8. 覺得輪班很累，失去熱情時怎麼辦？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「輪班是練功最快的方式。當我覺得疲乏，我會設定小目標：例如『這個月我要把某個常發生的 Alarm 徹底根治』。用解題的成就感驅動自己，並在休假時透過公路車騎乘徹底重置身心。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.motiv.xr5hsu","question":"9. 為什麼你是這份職缺的 Perfect Fit？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「我具備『台積裝機的高壓抗性』與『封測碩士的數據敏感度』。我懂機械硬體拆裝，也習慣看數據找 Root cause，這完美符合 RDA 需要的 Proactive Troubleshooting 能力。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.motiv.lp60nn","question":"10. 你的缺點是什麼？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「對於『優化細節』有時過於執著。例如我想把某個機台參數調到最完美而多花時間。但我現在學會了在『效率』與『完美』間設定停損點，以團隊的量產時程為第一優先。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"behav","label":"經歷行為","icon":"briefcase","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-l-4 border-sky-500\">經歷與行為 (STAR 法則)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"micron.behav.jwcrug","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 產線救火實例1. 印象最深刻的異常處理 (Troubleshooting)？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[S 情境]</strong> 在日月光產線，導入散熱材料時，點膠機台頻繁發生「針頭阻塞」與「溢膠」Alarm，導致產線 UPH 驟降，前線技術員抱怨連連。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[T 任務]</strong> 必須在不影響整體交期的情況下，快速找出根因 (Root Cause)，而非只是請技術員無止盡地更換針頭。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[A 行動]</strong> 我召集設備與製程，在白板上畫出<strong>魚骨圖 (Fishbone)</strong>。我們排除「機(壓力正常)」、「料(剛退冰正常)」後，聚焦於「環境」。我親赴產線比對，發現是冷氣出風口直吹機台，造成微觀的局部溫降，導致材料黏度瞬間飆高阻塞。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[R 結果]</strong> 我利用壓克力擋板改變機台氣流，並微調加熱盤補償溫度。此舉讓該 Alarm 率下降 80%。這證明我能用系統化工具解決產線痛點。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.behav.u1eoul","question":"2. 主動預防保養 (Proactive PM) 的經驗？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[S 情境]</strong> 傳統 PM 都是時間到了才換零件，有時會發生無預警 Down 機。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[T 任務]</strong> 降低非預期停機時間 (Unscheduled Downtime)。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[A 行動]</strong> 分析歷史 Log，發現某零件失效前，震動與電流有微幅上升趨勢。我將此設為監控指標，數值異常未達 Alarm 前，就提前在產能空檔排定檢修。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[R 結果]</strong> 避免量產中損壞，極大化稼動率，展現數據驅動預防保養能力。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.behav.2mry3n","question":"3. 參數調校與微調 (Parameter Fine-tuning)？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[S 情境]</strong> 導入 High K TIM 散熱材料初期，點膠易發生溢膠與孔洞(Void)。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[T 任務]</strong> 優化點膠參數，提升封裝良率。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[A 行動]</strong> 設計 DOE，針對點膠壓力、速度等變數進行交叉測試。利用超音波檢測(SAT)確認內部孔洞率。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[R 結果]</strong> 找到最佳 Recipe 參數，解決溢膠，證明我具備系統化調校參數的能力。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.behav.at8jgz","question":"4. 新機台導入 (Vendor Coordinate) 實例？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[S 情境]</strong> 台積 Fab22 2奈米新廠建置，需大量導入全新 AMAT PVD 機台。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[T 任務]</strong> 確保機台硬體就位並順利通過驗收 (Buy-off)。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[A 行動]</strong> 主動對齊廠務水電氣與 Vendor 派工時間。參與每日 Brief meeting 追蹤進度，親自檢視機台配管是否符合規範。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[R 結果]</strong> 新機台如期通過嚴格硬體驗證導入量產，培養了跨部門協調能力。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.behav.cin37n","question":"5. 高壓環境下的優先級排定 (Prioritization)？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[S 情境]</strong> 值班時，同時遇到產線趕貨(Hot run)、A機台亮紅燈 Alarm、B機台準備排定 PM。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[T 任務]</strong> 妥善調度，避免影響整體廠區 Throughput。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[A 行動]</strong> 排定優先級：1. 先處理 A 機台 Alarm(恢復產能最急)。2. 確保 Hot run 順利通過健康機台。3. 延後 B 機台 PM(若未達嚴重風險)。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[R 結果]</strong> 挺過當班危機無重大 Delay，能在動態環境中保持冷靜與大局觀。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.behav.cow4ly","question":"6. 輪班交接 (Handover) 的良好習慣？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[S 情境]</strong> 設備維護常遇到跨班次的長時 Troubleshoot，資訊斷層會導致重工。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[T 任務]</strong> 確保下一班工程師能無縫接軌。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[A 行動]</strong> 交接原則是「量化且條理分明」。在 Passdown 寫明：1. 異常現象與 Alarm Code。2. 當班「已嘗試過」哪些無效動作。3. 建議下一班優先執行的步驟。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[R 結果]</strong> 大幅減少溝通成本，確保 RDA 團隊的高效運作。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.behav.yf64l6","question":"7. 團隊協作與衝突處理 (Collaboration)？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[S 情境]</strong> 建置 End Point 系統時，新管線與舊機台發生干涉，廠務部與製程部互不相讓。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[T 任務]</strong> 化解衝突並找出可行的安裝方案。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[A 行動]</strong> 畫出 3D 空間配置圖，讓抽象管線走向具象化，並拿出廠規 SOP。用「客觀圖面與數據」引導雙方討論。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[R 結果]</strong> 成功修改轉接件導角，兼顧工安與散熱，雙方滿意放行。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.behav.wadat0","question":"8. 建立工具/系統的創新經驗？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[S 情境]</strong> 台積電舊有機台缺乏有效的即時監控機制，影響異常反應速度。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[T 任務]</strong> 提升機台監測效能。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[A 行動]</strong> 運用跨領域學習，從硬體線路規劃到軟體訊號對接，從無到有建置了 End Point 系統的硬體架構。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[R 結果]</strong> 獲得廠區佳作肯定，證明我具備將抽象概念化為真實系統的工程創造力。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.behav.9oecn5","question":"9. 管理 Vendor 的經驗？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[S 情境]</strong> 裝機專案時，Vendor 進度落後。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[T 任務]</strong> 推動 Vendor 趕上進度且確保品質。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[A 行動]</strong> 我不是只催促，而是跟他們一起看現場。發現氣體配管卡住後，立刻協調廠務放行。把 Vendor 當作夥伴而非下屬。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[R 結果]</strong> 排除施工障礙，Vendor 順利加速完工。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.behav.86r96t","question":"10. 犯過最蠢的錯誤與學習？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[S 情境]</strong> 操作 CNC 時，曾因太自信未按對角線上扭力就啟動主軸。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[T 任務]</strong> 承擔後果並修正習慣。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[A 行動]</strong> 導致工件微偏移報廢。立刻按下急停並承認錯誤。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 px-1 rounded\">[R 結果]</strong> 這次教訓深深烙印在肌肉記憶中。從此「嚴格遵守鎖固 SOP」成為我不可撼動的天條。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"sit","label":"情境應變","icon":"shield","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-l-4 border-sky-500\">情境與應變 (10題)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"micron.sit.1qrgpk","question":"1. PE 抱怨量測數據飄移，把鍋推給機台？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「用數據自證清白。我會立刻跑一次 Daily Monitor (如 Golden Wafer 測量)。如果機台底層狀態正常，我會把數據攤開，跟 PE 討論是否為上一站(如曝光/蝕刻)的製程變異，共同解決問題。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.sit.8d5lrx","question":"2. 設備商說廠務有問題，廠務說設備有問題？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「身為設備工程師，我是 Owner。我會拿儀器到界接點(Facility Hook-up)親自量測。用科學數據證明進水/進電是否達標，停止踢皮球。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.sit.d557s5","question":"3. 遇到從未見過的 Alarm 且手冊沒寫？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「確保 Safe State 後，展開 5 Whys 分析。回顧發生 Alarm 前的最後一個機械動作或參數變更。設下 Time-box (如30分鐘)，若仍無頭緒，立刻彙整 Log 升級(Escalate)給資深前輩或原廠。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.sit.wikbwb","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考核心4. 產能壓力大，長官要求跳過某項 PM 步驟？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「堅守品質底線。<span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold\">絕不私自跳過</span>。向長官說明該步驟(如光學元件清潔)對量測精度的關鍵影響，跳過可能導致整批 Wafer 報廢。可透過優化其他不影響品質的備料動作搶時間。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.sit.av4ia0","question":"5. FDC 顯示參數微幅飄移，但還沒亮 Alarm？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「這就是 Proactive PM 的好時機。持續監控飄移斜率，預判何時會碰 Control Limit。預先備妥替換零件，在下一個產能空檔主主介入檢修，避免機台在趕貨時當機。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.sit.wqr9eu","question":"6. 下班前 10 分鐘機台突然 Down 機？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「展現 Ownership。先將機台穩定，進行初步排查並拉出 Log。等下一班學長來時，詳細報告我剛才看到的現象與初步判斷，確保他完全掌握狀況後我才下班。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.sit.6k66qv","question":"7. 被指派接手完全陌生的量測機台型號？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「展現求知慾。要來原廠 Manual 快速掃描硬體架構(光源、載台)。主動爭取參與該機台的 PM 或跟著資深學長值班，透過『動手做』快速建立對新設備的肌肉記憶。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.sit.7mnzd1","question":"8. 發現公司 SOP 裡面有明顯的錯誤？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「不私自更改動作，但也絕不忽視。將錯誤的截圖與我的客觀數據/正確原廠手冊截圖彙整，提報給主管或撰寫 SOP 的單位，推動文件更新，這才是數據驅動的持續改善。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.sit.pycvbk","question":"9. PM 到一半發現備品(Spare parts)庫存沒了？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「立刻評估舊零件是否能安全撐到備品到貨。若不行，協調同廠區其他閒置機台零件借用。事後必須檢討料件最低安全庫存(Safety stock)水位，從系統面防堵。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"micron.sit.4nth3y","question":"10. 機台問題卡關很久，長官不耐煩詢問？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2\">\n                    💡 「穩住心態。向長官客觀報告目前已排除的變數、現在懷疑的 Root Cause、以及預計還需要多少時間測試。用邏輯與明確的 Time-box 讓長官安心。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]}]},"swancor":{"id":"swancor","name":"swancor","shortName":"swancor","status":"archived","role":"","eyebrow":"","title":"","summary":"","accent":"navy","categories":[{"id":"script","label":"專屬劇本","icon":"script","description":"","introHtml":"<div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-600 to-emerald-800 rounded-2xl shadow-md p-5 text-white mb-4\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-black mb-1\">上緯 研發人員劇本</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-emerald-100 text-[13px]\">策略：中山封測碩士 + 金屬TIM可靠度分析 + 日月光產線經驗</p>\n                </div>","questions":[{"id":"swancor.script.hwsgk","question":"研發職位自我介紹 (核心武裝)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                <p>各位主管好，我是莊瀚洲。我畢業於<strong>中山大學先進半導體封測研究所</strong>。</p>\n                                <p>針對「先進封裝材料研發」職位，我的優勢在於<strong>「真實封裝廠專案經驗」與「紮實的可靠度分析」</strong>。</p>\n                                <p>在日月光擔任產品工程師期間，我直接參與 High K TIM 的導入與參數優化專案。我非常清楚封裝廠對於新材料的規格要求、產線測試痛點，以及如何進行失效分析。</p>\n                                <p>此外，我的碩論專攻金屬 TIM 研究，深入探討微觀結構(IMC層)在溫度循環下的接合可靠度與裂紋生成機制。這與貴司針對樹脂、焊料進行配方優化的 JD 高度吻合。</p>\n                                <p>我不僅懂材料理論，更具備在台積電與日月光的「跨部門專案管理」經驗，能將封測廠的使用者端視角帶入上緯，開發具市場競爭力的高可靠度材料。</p>\n                            </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.script.554dlt","question":"Reverse Qs (向面試官提問)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-3 border-t border-emerald-100 pt-3 bg-white\">\n                                <p><span class=\"font-bold text-emerald-600\">1. 量產瓶頸：</span>我在日月光常發現實驗室與產線有落差。請問上緯開發封裝材料時，從 Lab scale 到 Mass production，目前最大的瓶頸通常在哪個環節？</p>\n                                <p><span class=\"font-bold text-emerald-600\">2. 高階分析：</span>除了基本熱力學測試，目前團隊最常使用的失效分析 (FA) 手段或高階測試設備有哪些？</p>\n                                <p><span class=\"font-bold text-emerald-600\">3. 新人里程碑：</span>以這個研發專案管理的角色，您期待新進工程師在前三個月達成什麼里程碑？</p>\n                            </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"tech","label":"專業邏輯","icon":"product","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">🧪 材料與測試 (10題)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"swancor.tech.cfnmfx","question":"1. JD寫樹脂/焊料，但你做金屬TIM？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「基底不同，但『熱傳導機制』與『可靠度邏輯』相通。都要面對 CTE 匹配與介面剝離。我熟悉的溫度循環測試與微裂紋分析，能無縫應用在樹脂與焊料優化。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.tech.gx5n8r","question":"2. 如何進行失效分析 (FA)？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「先用 SAT 或 X-ray 進行非破壞性定位，接著做 Cross-section 透過 SEM/EDX 分析介面層 (如 IMC 厚度)，確認是配方問題還是製程曲線問題，回饋研發端。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.tech.lgd6s4","question":"3. CTE (熱膨脹係數) 不匹配如何解決？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「在配方中加入適當比例與粒徑的 Filler (填充物) 來調整複合材料的 CTE，同時需平衡黏度(Viscosity)與流動性，確保點膠製程良率。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.tech.sficbu","question":"4. 解釋 IMC (介金屬化合物) 的影響？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「適當的 IMC 層能提供良好的冶金結合，提升導熱與強度；但 IMC 本身較脆，過厚會在 Temp Cycle 下產生裂紋，需透過配方與 Reflow 溫度控制。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.tech.f6vhkp","question":"5. 實驗室到產線量產的落差？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「Lab 是理想環境。產線會面臨點膠機針頭阻塞(Filler沉降)、機台溫控公差等問題。研發必須把『可製造性 (Manufacturability)』納入配方設計初期考量。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.tech.52xrf3","question":"6. 如何設計可靠度測試 (Reliability)？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「依 JEDEC 標準。主要包含 TCT (溫度循環測試)、HAST (高加速壽命測試) 等，模擬極端環境加速老化，驗證材料抗疲勞與抗濕氣能力。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.tech.hxw1wa","question":"7. 新材料導入的驗證流程？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「從材料基本物性測試 (TMA/DMA/DSC) -&gt; Dummy sample 試打驗證製程參數 -&gt; 實體封裝可靠度測試 -&gt; 量產可行性評估。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.tech.s5un0k","question":"8. 若發現封裝結構出現 Void (孔洞)？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「Void 可能是材料脫氣(Outgassing)、濕氣吸附或點膠圖形(Pattern)不佳包覆空氣。需切片確認 Void 位置，調整材料配方或製程真空度。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.tech.de3t0j","question":"9. 材料熱阻 (Thermal Resistance) 測量？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「使用 TIM Tester (如 ASTM D5470) 測量不同厚度下的熱阻，藉此推算出材料的本質熱傳導率與介面熱阻 (Interfacial Resistance)。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.tech.aavup3","question":"10. 測試數據出現異常偏差？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「先確認測試機台 Calibration，排除人為或環境變異。若確認為材料特性，則需檢視該批次原料成分或混合製程是否有變異，抓出根本原因。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"motiv","label":"動機特質","icon":"motivation","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">🎯 動機與特質 (10題)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"swancor.motiv.m3r3gc","question":"1. 為何選擇上緯的材料研發？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「我想從『應用端』走到『開發源頭』。在日月光我看到新封裝材料對良率的決定性影響。上緯在特用化學與材料的底蘊深厚，我想在此發揮我的封測分析專長。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.motiv.d70nhk","question":"2. 從設備轉向研發，能適應嗎？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「我的碩論就是在做純研發(金屬TIM研究)。設備工程師鍛鍊了我對機台變異的敏感度，這讓我在設計實驗與分析測試數據時，思維更全面，而不只是個實驗室學者。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.motiv.1dzece","question":"3. 為什麼我們不找純化學系的人？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「純化學系懂分子配方，但我懂『客戶端(封測廠)怎麼用』。我知道 CTE 不匹配會導致什麼機械應力失效。我的跨界背景能補足研發團隊在物理失效分析上的視角。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.motiv.64a50f","question":"4. 你在研發專案中最大的優勢？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「『專案控管能力』。我曾在村田主導建廠 Layout，在日月光主導新材料導入。我懂得規劃里程碑(Milestone)，讓研發不只是無止盡的實驗，而是能準時交付的產品。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.motiv.41mp0d","question":"5. 研發工作常面臨枯燥重複測試？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「重複測試是為了淬鍊可靠度。我會將重複性的工作SOP化甚至建立巨集分析數據。在枯燥的數據中找尋微小的配方變異趨勢，這正是研發的樂趣。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.motiv.75trbi","question":"6. 如何確保新材料符合市場需求？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「主動與市場端/業務端對齊規格。我在研發初期就會將『可製造性』與『成本』納入考量，確保開發出的配方不是實驗室精品，而是能為公司帶來獲利的量產品。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.motiv.okz2v6","question":"7. 工作地點在南投，你的意願？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「我對地點非常彈性。南投環境清幽，生活成本合理，非常適合專注於長期的研發工作。只要職務具備挑戰與成長性，地點完全不是問題。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.motiv.nehs7j","question":"8. 你認為優秀的研發工程師具備什麼？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「『對失敗的包容力』與『抽絲剝繭的邏輯』。實驗失敗是常態，優秀的研發能從失敗樣本的 Cross-section 或 Log 中找出 Root Cause，快速修正下一次的配方參數。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.motiv.9hd8k1","question":"9. 你的學習風格是什麼？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「『做中學 (Hands-on)』。面對新領域(如高分子化學)，我會先看底層理論，然後立刻進實驗室打樣測試。透過實體材料的反應來驗證理論，這是我最快的學習途徑。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.motiv.576mw2","question":"10. 未來3-5年的職涯目標？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「初期熟悉公司的配方體系與測試設備。中期希望能獨立主導一項新封裝材料的專案，從配方優化一路推到量產導入。長期希望能成為團隊內兼具『化學配方與物理失效分析』的跨界專家。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"behav","label":"經歷行為","icon":"briefcase","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">💼 經歷與行為 (STAR 法則)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"swancor.behav.ud2fsn","question":"1. 日月光 High K TIM 專案的細節？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-1 rounded\">[S]</strong> 參與高導熱材料導入 Flip Chip 專案。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-1 rounded\">[T]</strong> 解決初期材料溢膠與孔洞(Void)問題。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-1 rounded\">[A]</strong> 設計 DOE 調整點膠壓力與速度，以超音波(SAT)確認孔洞率。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-1 rounded\">[R]</strong> 找到最佳 Recipe，提升散熱效能與良率。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.behav.btwy6u","question":"2. 實驗室與產線數據不同時如何處理？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-1 rounded\">[S]</strong> 實驗室點膠完美，產線卻發生針頭阻塞。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-1 rounded\">[T]</strong> 找出變異源並解決產線問題。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-1 rounded\">[A]</strong> 親赴產線比對機台溫控，發現溫度差異導致黏度變化。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-1 rounded\">[R]</strong> 回饋數據給研發端微調配方寬容度，解決阻塞。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.behav.n8okzq","question":"3. 跨部門合作 (研發 vs. 製造) 的挑戰？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「製造部只要良率跟速度，研發要推新材料。我會擔任橋樑，用製造部聽得懂的『UPH (每小時產出)』與『不良率』數據，說服他們嘗試新參數，而非只講材料理論。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.behav.uyp06o","question":"4. 最難忘的一次失效分析 (FA)？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「碩論時金屬 TIM 在溫度循環後出現微裂紋。我透過 SEM/EDX 發現是特定 IMC 層過厚導致脆化。這讓我學會從『微觀結構』去解釋『宏觀失效』現象。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.behav.gvhmmh","question":"5. 與外部供應商/學術機構合作經驗？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「日月光產學專案中，我負責對接成大/中山實驗室。我負責將學術界前瞻的材料數據，轉化為廠區內可執行的製程規格，具備將學術落地為工業應用的經驗。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.behav.nym7ed","question":"6. 如何在有限時間內做好專案管理？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「建立 Gantt Chart 標出 Critical Path。當新材料打樣延遲，我會同步先進行治具準備與測試機台排程(平行作業)，確保最終驗證 Milestone 不 Delay。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.behav.p6m6c0","question":"7. 處理過最複雜的數據分析？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「分析不同溫度循環條件下的材料熱阻變化趨勢。數據雜亂時，我會利用統計軟體剔除離群值(Outliers)，並找出熱阻上升與 IMC 成長厚度的高度正相關性。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.behav.3311yo","question":"8. 面對不完整的測試數據如何決策？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「風險評估。如果無法取得完整壽命數據，我會先做加速老化測試(HAST)抓趨勢。若趨勢符合預期，則先推進小批量試產(Pilot run)，同時持續收集長期數據。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.behav.dqvr1y","question":"9. 跳出舒適圈的經驗？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「大學是純機械，但研究所跨足半導體封裝材料。這需要重拾材料化學熱力學。我透過大量研讀 Paper 並親手做實驗，成功跨越了學科壁壘。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.behav.lgq5ls","question":"10. 職涯中最大的專業成就？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「完成金屬 TIM 的碩士論文。我不僅證明了銦合金的熱傳導優勢，更具體找出了最佳的 IMC 穩定相，這份研究對高階封裝散熱有著實質的工業參考價值。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"sit","label":"情境應變","icon":"shield","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">🛡️ 情境與應變 (10題)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"swancor.sit.o701za","question":"1. 新材料在實驗室完美，產線卻狂報廢？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「立刻 Hold 住產線。拿報廢品做 Cross-section，同時調閱產線機台 Log (如點膠壓力、Reflow溫度曲線)。比對與實驗室的差異，找出變異源並調整配方寬容度。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.sit.ebntsu","question":"2. 老闆壓死線，但測試還沒做完？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「堅守品質底線，但提供解決方案。我會向老闆報告：『核心可靠度測試不能省，否則有客訴風險。但我可以加班並行處理其他測試，或請求調度資源加速測項。』」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.sit.gurb6f","question":"3. 關鍵 FA 設備在專案緊急時壞了？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「啟動備案。1. 聯絡設備商緊急維修。2. 聯絡成大/中山等熟識的大學實驗室或第三方檢測機構(如宜特/閎康)外包測試，確保專案進度不受機台 down 機影響。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.sit.14gvtk","question":"4. 原料供應商偷偷更改配方導致異常？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「利用 FTIR 或 DSC 測出原料物性變異，拿出數據要求供應商給出 8D Report。同時研發端必須建立嚴格的 IQC (進料檢驗) 規範防堵未來類似事件。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.sit.imyj70","question":"5. 遇到從未見過的材料失效模式？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「回到物理化學第一性原理。搜集各種環境極端參數做交叉比對，查閱最新國際文獻，並與團隊內資深專家 Brainstorming，不帶預設立場去解構問題。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.sit.44gjh0","question":"6. 發現同事隱瞞測試數據的不良率？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「誠信是研發的底線。我會私下嚴肅提醒他這會導致未來量產巨大的賠償風險，要求他重測或如實上報；若他不聽，我會為了公司利益向主管 escalate。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.sit.oqgzuu","question":"7. 多個研發專案同時撞期？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「排定優先級。依照『客戶訂單急迫性』、『市場潛力』與『資源重疊度』排序。主動向主管回報產能瓶頸，爭取資源或協調較不緊急項目的 Deadline。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.sit.w3dcet","question":"8. 客戶(如封測廠)抱怨你們的材料很難用？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「我在封測廠待過，懂他們的痛。我會親自前往客戶端看他們的操作手法與機台參數，確認是『配方設計問題』還是『客戶製程不匹配』，提供技術支援共同解題。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.sit.7kvy39","question":"9. 性能極佳，但成本太高無法量產？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「研發不能只追求極致。我會重新檢視配方，尋找性能相近但成本較低的替代 Filler(填充物)，或者透過優化合成製程來降低製造成本，尋求商業平衡點。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"swancor.sit.24q2u","question":"10. 發現自己已發布的配方有潛在瑕疵？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「立刻回報主管，並同步啟動影響範圍評估(是否已出貨給客戶)。主動承擔責任，提出緊急對策(如限制使用條件)與長期修正方案(配方改版)。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]}]},"skyeuv":{"id":"skyeuv","name":"skyeuv","shortName":"skyeuv","status":"archived","role":"","eyebrow":"","title":"","summary":"","accent":"navy","categories":[{"id":"script","label":"專屬劇本","icon":"script","description":"","introHtml":"<div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-600 to-purple-800 rounded-2xl shadow-md p-5 text-white mb-4\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-black mb-1\">天虹 設備／機構工程師劇本</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-purple-100 text-[13px]\">策略：北科純機械 + 3DCAD/CNC實作 + 台積PVD真空經驗</p>\n                </div>","questions":[{"id":"skyeuv.script.h8herc","question":"機構職位自我介紹 (核心武裝)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3\">\n                                <p>各位主管好，我是莊瀚洲。針對「機構工程師」，我具備<strong>「3D CAD設計」、「純機械實作底蘊」與「半導體真空機台經驗」</strong>的黃金三角。</p>\n                                <p>我畢業於北科大機械系，精通 SolidWorks，更考取了 <strong>CNC 銑床與車床技術士證照</strong>。這代表我設計的機構絕對具備「可加工性(DFM)」，不會畫出做不出來的理想圖。</p>\n                                <p>其次，貴司強調真空與光學整合。我在台積電擔任 PVD 工程師，極度熟悉極高真空腔體拆裝、O-ring 密封防漏，以及高精度模組鎖固。</p>\n                                <p>我在村田機械也獨立使用 CAD 規劃過 AS/RS 廠區 Layout。我熱忱投入前端設備 Prototype 開發，結合實作與半導體經驗，定能為團隊帶來實質貢獻。</p>\n                            </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.script.554dlt","question":"Reverse Qs (向面試官提問)","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed space-y-3 border-t border-purple-100 pt-3 bg-white\">\n                                <p><span class=\"font-bold text-purple-600\">1. 真空等級：</span>我在台積維護過極高真空機台，請問貴司目前自動檢測設備，真空度大約落在哪個等級？材料選用最考量 Outgassing 還是成本？</p>\n                                <p><span class=\"font-bold text-purple-600\">2. 減振挑戰：</span>原型開發中，機構端最大挑戰是克服外部環境微震動，還是內部自動化機構作動造成的震動？</p>\n                                <p><span class=\"font-bold text-purple-600\">3. 迭代週期：</span>一個 Prototype 專案從 CAD 設計、發包加工到組裝驗證，通常 Cycle time 多久？光學與機構如何技術對接？</p>\n                            </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"weakness","label":"弱點補強","icon":"chart","description":"","introHtml":"<div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-600 to-purple-700 rounded-2xl shadow-md p-5 text-white\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black mb-1\">天虹設備商面試弱點補強</h2><p class=\"text-rose-100 text-[13px]\">把 Fab 使用者經驗轉化為設計、測試、交機與客戶支援能力</p></div>","questions":[{"id":"skyeuv.weakness.x09tr0","question":"1. 為什麼從晶圓廠轉到設備商？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed space-y-2\"><p>晶圓廠經驗讓我知道客戶真正重視設備穩定性、維修效率、操作便利性、文件完整度及異常支援速度。我希望把 Fab 端經驗帶到設備商，從設計、測試到交機都提前思考客戶痛點。</p><p>我的機械、CNC、CAD 與 PVD 真空設備背景，能同時理解加工性、密封、維修空間與量產需求。</p></div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.weakness.4fxj80","question":"2. 天虹短、中、長期職涯規劃","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed space-y-3\"><p><strong class=\"text-purple-700\">短期：</strong>熟悉產品架構、真空系統、測漏、圖面規範、組裝 SOP 與驗證，能獨立完成基礎模組設計及排障。</p><p><strong class=\"text-purple-700\">中期：</strong>獨立負責設備模組或 Prototype，從需求、CAD、DFM、發包、組裝、測試到客戶回饋形成閉環。</p><p><strong class=\"text-purple-700\">長期：</strong>成為能整合真空、機構、薄膜製程與客戶需求的系統工程師，負責平台改善、新產品導入及新人培訓。</p></div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.weakness.ymy3fv","question":"3. 客戶設備突然抽不到真空，怎麼處理？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed\"><ol class=\"list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2\"><li>先讓設備進入 Safe state，停止可能損傷 Pump 或污染腔體的動作。</li><li>確認 Gauge、Valve、Pump、Foreline 與 Interlock。</li><li>比較正常 Pump-down curve，判斷抽不下來、速度變慢或停在固定壓力。</li><li>分段隔離腔體、管路與 Pump。</li><li>依型態執行氦氣測漏、RGA、O-ring、污染及 Outgassing 排查。</li><li>修復後重做 Pump-down、Leak rate 與 Qualification。</li></ol><p class=\"bg-purple-50 rounded-lg p-3 mt-3\"><strong>設備商加分：</strong>將失效模式回饋到設計端，例如增加隔離閥、改善 O-ring 溝槽、移除盲孔、增加測試 Port 或維修空間。</p></div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"vacuum","label":"真空題庫","icon":"shield","description":"","introHtml":"<div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-700 to-slate-900 rounded-2xl shadow-md p-5 text-white\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black mb-1\">真空、測漏、質譜與薄膜機台複習</h2><p class=\"text-violet-100 text-[13px]\">設備商面試版：原理、判斷方式、實務步驟與設計改善</p></div>","questions":[{"id":"skyeuv.vacuum.ar9bp0","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考1. 真空系統的組成與抽氣順序","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed\">基本組成包含腔體、管路、閥門、前級 Pump、高真空 Pump、壓力計、Vent／Purge、控制與 Interlock。先以 Dry／Rotary Pump 粗抽；達切換壓力後才連通 Turbo／Cryo Pump；最後確認 Base pressure、Pump-down time、Leak rate 與 RGA。高真空 Pump 不可任意從大氣壓直接工作。</div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.vacuum.12uzg7","question":"2. Dry、Turbo、Cryo Pump 比較","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed\">Dry Pump 用於粗抽／前級，污染低但要注意粉塵、腐蝕與排氣；Turbo 以高速葉片輸送分子，需要前級 Pump，怕大氣衝擊與異物；Cryo 以低溫冷凝與吸附捕捉氣體，潔淨且抽速高，但需定期 Regeneration。比較時要談氣體負載、污染、維護、成本與可維修性。</div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.vacuum.a4b4hd","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考3. 真空度停在固定壓力如何判斷？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed\">依序確認 Gauge 種類與校正、Pump-down curve、Valve／Foreline／Pump 狀態；做 Rate-of-rise 區分漏氣與 Outgassing；用 Isolation test 分段隔離，再以氦測漏及 RGA 判斷 Air leak、水氣、油氣、製程殘留或 Virtual leak。</div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.vacuum.bmvjj8","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考4. 氦質譜測漏：真空法與吸槍法","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed\">真空噴吹法是將待測物抽真空，外部少量噴氦；正壓吸槍法是在待測物內充氦，外部以 Sniffer 搜尋。實務上先確認背景值與反應時間，從設備較高處、離 Pump 較遠處開始，少量緩慢噴吹；訊號出現後停止並等背景恢復，再縮小範圍。</div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.vacuum.srzu9c","question":"5. RGA 原理與常見 m/z","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed\">電子撞擊使殘餘氣體游離，Quadrupole 依 m/z 篩選。常見：2 氫、4 氦、18 水、28 氮／CO、32 氧、40 氬、44 二氧化碳／有機碎片。大氣漏氣常見 28 與 32 同升，約呈 4:1；水或有機碎片偏高但無完整大氣比例，需考慮 Outgassing 或污染。</div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.vacuum.7k6drf","question":"6. 大氣壓質譜與真空質譜差異","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed\">ESI、APCI 等可在接近大氣壓處產生離子，再經小孔、Skimmer 與差動抽氣導入真空分析器。設備端要同時關注大氣端霧化、溶劑、氣流與污染，以及真空端 Orifice、Pump load、真空穩定及離子傳輸效率。</div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.vacuum.afqwy","question":"⭐⭐⭐ 必考7. 初階 PVD 薄膜機台模組","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed\">主要包含 Load lock、Transfer module、Process chamber、Target／Source、Gas delivery、DC／RF Power、Substrate stage、Vacuum system、Gauge／Throttle valve、Cooling 與 Interlock。面試時要能從 Wafer 進機、抽氣、傳送、沉積、冷卻到出片描述完整流程。</div>","tip":"","priority":"must","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.vacuum.r8666t","question":"8. Sputtering 原理與關鍵參數","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed\">低壓 Ar 形成 Plasma，Ar+ 轟擊 Target，使原子濺射並沉積。關鍵參數：Base／Process pressure、Power、Gas flow、Target-to-substrate distance、Temperature、Bias、Target condition；它們影響沉積速率、均勻性、緻密度、應力、附著及 Particle。</div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.vacuum.zeg2gx","question":"9. 膜厚或均勻性異常排查","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed\">先排除量測與 Recipe 錯誤，再查看時間、Power、Pressure、Gas flow、Bias trend；檢查 Target 壽命、Wafer rotation、Clamp／ESC、Shield 堆膜、MFC、Throttle valve 與 Gauge 漂移。依 Center／Edge、Chamber、Recipe、時間層別，修復後用 Monitor wafer 驗證。</div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.vacuum.v9vj5q","question":"10. 如何減少 Virtual Leak","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed\">避免密閉盲孔與夾層，使用 Vent screw／Vent groove；選低 Outgassing 材料並做好清洗烘烤；避免 O-ring 溝槽形成困氣空間；縮短細長管路、提高 Conductance，並在設計審查加入 Vacuum DFM／DFA Checklist。</div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.vacuum.z708b3","question":"11. Leak、Outgassing 與 Virtual Leak 如何區分？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed\"><strong>Leak</strong> 是外界氣體由固定路徑進入；<strong>Outgassing</strong> 是材料、表面吸附水氣或污染物在真空下釋放；<strong>Virtual Leak</strong> 常是盲孔、夾層或螺紋底部困住氣體後慢慢釋放。實務上以 Pump-down curve、Rate-of-rise、烘烤前後趨勢、RGA 與氦測漏交叉判讀，不用單一現象直接下結論。</div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.vacuum.j0adef","question":"12. PVD 腔體要開蓋／拆裝前的安全思考？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] border-t pt-3 leading-relaxed\">先依廠內 SOP 完成停機、隔離能源、放氣／冷卻、確認無殘留壓力與化學／電力風險，再確認吊掛、重物、夾傷、銳邊與污染控制。拆裝時記錄零件版本與密封面狀態，組回後依規範做 Leak check、Pump-down 與 Qualification。面試時先講安全和程序，再談技術動作，會比直接講「我會拆 O-ring」更成熟。</div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"tech","label":"專業邏輯","icon":"assembly","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">🚀 溫故知新：真空與薄膜技術</h3><h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">⚙️ 腔體與光學機構 (10題)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"skyeuv.tech.vflwbn","question":"1. 設備真空系統的建立與抽氣流程？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-purple-800 border-t border-purple-100 pt-2 leading-relaxed bg-white\">\n                    <p>真空無法一蹴可幾，必須分段抽氣，避免氣流擾動產生微粒(Particle)污染或損壞高真空 Pump。</p>\n                    <ul class=\"list-decimal pl-4 mt-1 space-y-1\">\n                        <li><strong>粗抽 (Roughing)：</strong> 先使用 Dry Pump (乾式幫浦) 從大氣壓抽到低真空 (約 10⁻² Torr)。</li>\n                        <li><strong>高真空 (High Vacuum)：</strong> 達到切換壓力後，開啟高真空閥，利用 Turbo Pump (渦輪分子幫浦) 或 Cryo Pump (冷凝幫浦) 將腔體抽至極高真空 (約 10⁻⁷ Torr 以下)。</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 font-bold text-rose-600\">💡 面試應答：</p>\n                    <p>「在台積維護 PVD 時，我非常熟悉這套切換邏輯。設計設備時，必須精算腔體體積與 Pump 抽速，確保 Pump down time 符合客戶的 UPH 需求。」</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.tech.e6yiyx","question":"2. 氦氣測漏 (Helium Leak Test) 實務作業？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-purple-800 border-t border-purple-100 pt-2 leading-relaxed bg-white\">\n                    <p>選用氦氣是因為它分子極小、呈惰性且背景濃度極低。主要有兩種做法：</p>\n                    <ul class=\"list-disc pl-4 mt-1 space-y-1\">\n                        <li><strong>噴吹法 (Spray/真空法)：</strong> 腔體抽真空，在外部接縫、O-ring 處噴灑氦氣。若有漏，氦氣被吸入，測漏儀即會 Alarm。(PVD機台最常用)</li>\n                        <li><strong>吸槍法 (Sniffer/正壓法)：</strong> 管路內部充入高壓氦氣，用測漏儀吸槍在外部偵測。(常用於氣體管路/Gas panel)</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 font-bold text-rose-600\">💡 面試應答：</p>\n                    <p>「先確認背景值與反應時間，從設備較高處、離 Pump 較遠的位置開始，逐步往下搜尋。氦氣應少量、緩慢噴吹；發現訊號後停止並等待背景恢復，再縮小到特定 Flange、Feedthrough 或 O-ring，避免環境氦氣累積造成誤判。」</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.tech.chvvjg","question":"3. 質譜儀(RGA) 應用與真實/虛擬漏氣分辨？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-purple-800 border-t border-purple-100 pt-2 leading-relaxed bg-white\">\n                    <p>RGA (殘餘氣體分析儀) 是一種小型質譜儀，用於量測腔體內的氣體成分比例。</p>\n                    <ul class=\"list-disc pl-4 mt-1 space-y-1\">\n                        <li><strong>真實漏氣 (Real Leak)：</strong> RGA 顯示 Mass 28 (氮氣) 與 Mass 32 (氧氣) 飆高 (比例約 4:1，同大氣比例)，代表腔體破損或 O-ring 沒裝好。</li>\n                        <li><strong>虛擬漏氣 (Virtual Leak / Outgassing)：</strong> RGA 只有 Mass 18 (水氣) 很高，代表腔體內部材料吸附水分或機構有「盲孔」困住氣體，在真空下緩慢釋放。</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 font-bold text-rose-600\">💡 面試應答：</p>\n                    <p>「為避免虛擬漏氣，我在設計真空零件時，絕對會將盲孔設計成『通孔』或預留『退氣槽 (Venting hole)』，這能大幅降低設備在客戶端的抽氣時間。」</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.tech.8unsb0","question":"4. 初階薄膜機台 (PVD) 核心概念？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-purple-800 border-t border-purple-100 pt-2 leading-relaxed bg-white\">\n                    <p><strong>PVD (物理氣相沉積 - 濺鍍 Sputtering)：</strong> 在極高真空中通入氬氣 (Ar) 並激發成電漿 (Plasma)。帶正電的氬離子加速撞擊 Target (靶材)，將靶材原子撞飛出，沉積在 Wafer 上。全程無化學反應。</p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 font-bold text-rose-600\">💡 面試應答：</p>\n                    <p>「在台積維護 AMAT Endura，我深知 PVD 對於『電漿穩定度』的嚴苛要求。機構設計的任何微小瑕疵(如接地面不良)都會引發 Arcing (打弧) 導致晶圓報廢。我有實戰經驗，能在設備開發階段就排除這些量產風險。」</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.tech.swdng7","question":"1. 真空腔體設計經驗與考量？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「在台積負責PVD讓我對真空極敏感。設計時注意：1.表面處理減低除氣(Outgassing)。2. O-ring 溝槽公差與壓縮率。3.抽氣/破真空的流場，避免污染光學鏡片。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.tech.3uah00","question":"2. 高精度光學治具與減振設計？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「光學最怕熱變形與微震。選用低熱膨脹係數材料(Invar)。定位考慮 Kinematic mount (點面線接觸) 消除過度拘束。減振可評估被動隔振墊或主動氣墊阻尼。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.tech.9s1pfp","question":"3. 什麼是可製造性設計 (DFM)？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 秀出 CNC 證照。「畫完 3D 圖，我腦中會模擬刀具路徑。能用銑床一刀做的，絕不設計需要特規放電加工的死角，大幅降低 Prototype 加工成本與時間。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.tech.ba7j2q","question":"4. 如何進行氦氣測漏 (Helium Leak Test)？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「抽真空後，在腔體外部焊接處或 O-ring 接縫處噴灑微量氦氣，利用氦氣分子小易穿透的特性，觀察質譜儀是否出現漏率峰值。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.tech.1m5kfh","question":"5. SolidWorks 實務與干涉檢查？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「建置大型次系統時，我會妥善管理 Top-down/Bottom-up 組合件，並定期跑干涉檢查(Interference Detection)，預留走線(Routing)與手部維修空間。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.tech.paynxv","question":"6. 材料科學在機構設計的應用？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「我的封測材料碩士經驗讓我對金屬疲勞、CTE 不匹配非常敏感。設計高精密定位平台時，選材不僅看強度，更要看熱穩定性與剛性。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.tech.2471eq","question":"7. 如何處理機械振動問題？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「先進行模態分析(Modal Analysis)找出機構的自然頻率，避免與馬達工作頻率產生共振。必要時增加補強肋提升剛性，或加入阻尼材料吸振。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.tech.3fnm4p","question":"8. 熱力學在真空腔體設計的考量？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「真空中缺乏對流散熱，熱傳導主要靠傳導與輻射。機構發熱源必須設計良好的實體熱傳導路徑(如水冷盤)，避免光學元件因積熱而變形。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.tech.xfqnb0","question":"9. 流體動力學與無塵室氣流？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「機構外型設計需盡量維持流線，避免產生渦流(Eddy current)造成微粒(Particle)停滯。在台積維護機台的經驗讓我非常注重防微粒的機構細節。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.tech.z94bz1","question":"10. 撰寫技術文件 (BOM/SOP) 的經驗？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「不僅是產出圖紙，更要建立精確的 BOM 表，標註公差與表面處理。我也習慣將組裝步驟圖文化，建立 Prototype 的第一版組裝 SOP 供後續生產參考。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"motiv","label":"動機特質","icon":"motivation","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">🎯 動機與特質 (10題)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"skyeuv.motiv.aaiiey","question":"1. 為何選擇加入設備商（天虹）？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「在台積電我看過最頂尖的成熟設備；但我更渴望『從 0 到 1』打造設備的成就感。新創環境的高自由度與快速迭代，能最大化發揮我的機械設計與實作熱忱。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.motiv.3ewk7w","question":"2. 放棄大廠(TSMC)的光環不覺得可惜？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「大廠讓我學會了嚴謹的 SOP 與高標準；但我的靈魂是個『Maker (創客)』。做機構設計、畫 3D 圖、解決工程問題才是我真正有熱情、能當作終身事業的事。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.motiv.y4lp5y","question":"3. 你對 Prototype (原型機) 開發的熱情？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「看著螢幕上的 CAD 模型，經過 CNC 加工，最後鎖上螺絲動起來的那一刻，是機械工程師的極致浪漫。我享受這種不斷 Test &amp; Learn 的除錯過程。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.motiv.ly2q56","question":"4. 如何適應新創公司模糊、多變的環境？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「我適應力極強。沒有 SOP，我就去創造 SOP。遇到不懂的光學或軟體介面，我會主動跨部門討教。在變動中找出最佳解，正是我這個職位的價值。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.motiv.wwehp8","question":"5. 應徵機構工程師，你最大的優勢？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「『實戰導向的設計力』。很多人只會畫圖，但我有 CNC 證照懂加工限制，又有 PVD 裝機經驗懂真實無塵室痛點。我的圖不會是空中樓閣，而是好做、好維修的機構。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.motiv.nzcg69","question":"6. CNC 證照對這個職缺真的有幫助嗎？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「幫助巨大。在設計光學治具時，我腦中會有刀具走位。我能避免設計出需要特規放電加工的深孔，這能幫公司大幅節省 Prototype 的打樣成本與時間。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.motiv.m3sz07","question":"7. 在輝虹未來的 3-5 年職涯規劃？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「前兩年專精於光學/真空機構的 Prototype 迭代開發，成為團隊主力設計。3-5 年希望能涉獵系統自動化整合，將原型機成功推進到量產階段。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.motiv.vfm6py","question":"8. 什麼驅使你不斷創新？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「解決不便與痛點的渴望。例如在台積電實習時，發現機台監測的不足，我便從無到有建置了 End Point 系統。這種『用工程系統改善現狀』的直覺，是我創新的動力。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.motiv.q4eei0","question":"9. 如何面對快速迭代 (Rapid iteration) 的壓力？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「迭代就是把錯誤提早發生。我不怕圖紙被打槍，反而期待快速組裝測試後抓出 bug。我會保持彈性，用參數化設計(Parametric Design)讓修改更快速。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.motiv.cstpzp","question":"10. 為什麼你是這個團隊的 Perfect Fit？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「因為我具備『設計大腦』與『現場雙手』。我能和光學工程師談微米級公差，也能和加工廠談刀具進給，更能自己拿起扳手組裝真空腔體。這正是 Prototype 團隊最需要的戰力。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"behav","label":"經歷行為","icon":"briefcase","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">💼 經歷與行為 (STAR 法則)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"skyeuv.behav.kcgd1j","question":"1. 從無到有設計系統的經驗？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-1 rounded\">[S]</strong> 在村田機械實習時，接手 TSMC AP6B 新廠的自動化倉儲規劃。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-1 rounded\">[T]</strong> 需要在受限的無塵室空間內，規劃出最高效的 AS/RS 系統 Layout。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-1 rounded\">[A]</strong> 評估廠區限制，使用 3D CAD 繪製軌道動線，並與跨部門確認無干涉。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-1 rounded\">[R]</strong> 成功產出可執行的實體藍圖，證明了處理大型系統的空間配置能力。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.behav.l0am0h","question":"2. 解決過最嚴重的機構衝突？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-3 space-y-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-1 rounded\">[S]</strong> 在台積電參與 End Point 系統建置時，新感測器外殼與原有設備發生空間干涉。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-1 rounded\">[T]</strong> 需要在不破壞安全規範且不延誤工期的前提下，找到安裝方案。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-1 rounded\">[A]</strong> 我利用 CAD 畫出 3D 配置圖，修改轉接件導角，並拿廠房 SOP 與各部門溝通。</p>\n                    <p><strong class=\"text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-1 rounded\">[R]</strong> 完美兼顧走線與散熱，順利放行安裝。</p>\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.behav.su03an","question":"3. 台積電 PVD 經驗如何應用在機構設計？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「我看過原廠(AMAT)最頂級的真空腔體與 Robot Arm。我知道防護罩怎麼設計才好拆，管線怎麼走才不會被機構夾斷，這些 User Experience 都能融入我的設計。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.behav.7491qi","question":"4. 設計時如何權衡『成本 vs. 性能』？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「除非是光學核心定位件必須用高級材料(如 Invar)與精密公差，否則在框架或非關鍵部位，我會選用標準鋁擠型或放寬公差，把預算刀口花在關鍵模組上。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.behav.a3ky63","question":"5. 管理/對接外部加工廠的經驗？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「我懂加工語言。發包時我會清楚標示基準面與公差。如果加工廠說某個特徵做不出來，我能跟他們討論是否改用分件鎖固或修改刀徑，確保零件順利產出。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.behav.1sa3em","question":"6. 具體展現 DFM (可製造性設計) 的例子？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「設計盲孔時預留退刀槽，或者統一螺絲規格避免組裝換工具。我設計的零件，會讓 CNC 操作員少換刀、少翻面，這直接降低了 Prototype 的製造成本。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.behav.cw5maf","question":"7. 處理過設計在測試階段失敗的經驗？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「測試金屬散熱材料時發生介面剝離。我沒有重做整個配方，而是切開樣本用 SEM 確認，發現是特定 IMC 層過厚。針對性修改溫度曲線後便解決了問題。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.behav.k8dvnl","question":"8. 跨領域學習 (如光學/電控) 的經驗？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「在台積建置 End Point 系統時，我從純機械跨足去了解光學感測器原理與軟體信號。我習慣主動學習跨界語言，這讓我在系統整合時溝通無障礙。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.behav.awe0es","question":"9. 最困難的 3D CAD 建模挑戰？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「處理擁有大量零件的大型建廠 Layout。我學會使用次組合件(Sub-assembly)來管理樹狀圖，並善用『輕量化』模式確保電腦運算流暢，展現了我的軟體熟練度。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.behav.l28ddu","question":"10. 最自豪的一項機械設計/規劃？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「在村田機械時獨立規劃的 TSMC AP6B AS/RS Layout。我必須用 CAD 在受限廠房內完美配置軌道，確保運作流暢無干涉，證明了我處理大型系統的空間配置能力。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]},{"id":"sit","label":"情境應變","icon":"shield","description":"","introHtml":"<h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-800 text-lg mb-3 pl-1 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">🛡️ 情境與應變 (10題)</h3>","questions":[{"id":"skyeuv.sit.joahqb","question":"1. 加工廠說你的零件圖『做不出來』？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「我會親自拿圖面與師傅討論。了解是刀具干涉、夾治具難做，還是材料變形。利用我的 CNC 背景與他們探討是否改用分件加工，或是放寬非關鍵公差。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.sit.eiypji","question":"2. 原型機組裝時發生嚴重干涉？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「立即現場 Trouble-shooting。若干涉量小，我會利用我在 CNC 廠的實作手感打磨修改。同時記錄修改處，回到 CAD 端發布變更設計(ECO)，確保下一版圖面正確。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.sit.5owq9v","question":"3. 光學團隊要求物理上難以達成的公差？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「用成本與風險溝通。『要達到極端公差，加工成本會翻倍且良率極低。我們能否改用機構微調螺絲(Micrometer)搭配軟體補償，來取代對單一零件的要求？』」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.sit.h3i3h","question":"4. 測試時真空腔體持續漏氣？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「系統化排查。1. 先確保 Pump 效能正常。2. 檢查各 Flange 與 O-ring 表面是否有刮傷。3. 使用氦氣測漏儀(Helium Leak Detector)精準找出漏率點，重新鎖固或更換密封材。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.sit.h5izkx","question":"5. 發現機構防振設計失效，光學影像模糊？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「確認震源。是外部地板微震，還是內部馬達/風扇作動震動？切斷內部動源交叉測試。若是內部，考慮增加馬達柔性墊片；若是外部，重新計算重心並更換光學桌阻尼參數。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.sit.xkaxkp","question":"6. 明天要 Demo，但關鍵零件被海關卡住？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「展現機動性。我會利用廠內的 3D 列印機，或運用我的機加工能力在銑床上快速做一個堪用的 Dummy Part 來應急 Demo，事後再換上正式零件。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.sit.w4bwvg","question":"7. 極度不認同資深前輩的機構設計？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「對事不對人。我會先私下畫出我的版本，利用 CAE 應力分析數據或干涉檢查結果，客觀展示兩種方案的優缺點，以『探討優化可能性』的態度與前輩溝通。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.sit.zbukpd","question":"8. 零件已發包才發現圖面畫錯？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「第一時間打給加工廠暫停加工。如果已經上機，評估錯的地方能否透過補焊、擴孔或增加轉接件來補救。主動向主管認錯並提出補救方案，不隱瞞。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.sit.6c3ptw","question":"9. 新創強調『快速迭代』與『嚴謹文件』的衝突？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「開發初期以敏捷為主，草圖或口頭對焦即發包；但當 Prototype 驗證通過準備轉入小批量產時，我會收斂所有變更，補齊標準 BOM 與 2D 圖紙，確保知識資產留下。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]},{"id":"skyeuv.sit.bq52z3","question":"10. 被指派處理完全不懂的流體/熱傳模組？","answerHtml":"<div class=\"px-4 pb-4 text-[13px] text-slate-600 border-t pt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 「這是最棒的學習機會。我會先利用 ChatGPT 或文獻抓出核心物理公式，運用現成模組(如現成水冷板)進行第一輪實驗，不鑽牛角尖，用數據引導設計優化。」\n                </div>","tip":"","priority":"standard","language":"zh-TW","tags":[]}]}]}}};
